1
00:01:52,505 --> 00:02:07,565
Visit turkision.com for more!

2
00:02:08,720 --> 00:02:10,758
Gonca, come. My Gonca.
You'll be fine.

3
00:02:13,080 --> 00:02:16,639
Gonca, come. My Gonca.

4
00:02:26,080 --> 00:02:30,639
Here, who are you?!

5
00:02:30,640 --> 00:02:34,119
You won't get away now! I will kill you!

6
00:02:40,600 --> 00:02:45,639
Gonca, Gonca!

7
00:02:47,080 --> 00:02:50,119
My Gonca. My gazelle-eyed.

8
00:02:50,120 --> 00:02:53,119
My gazelle-eyed, you will be alright.

9
00:02:53,600 --> 00:02:57,639
Alaeddin. I need to go.

10
00:02:57,640 --> 00:03:04,119
I need to go. My brother.,
my brother would kill me.

11
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:12,119
Gonca! Gonca open your eyes!

12
00:03:12,120 --> 00:03:18,639
Open your gazelle eyes! Get
up, come on you will be alright!

13
00:03:19,080 --> 00:03:24,639
You will be alright my Gonca!

14
00:03:25,080 --> 00:03:30,639
The decision has been made.
There is no turning back nor time left.

15
00:03:31,600 --> 00:03:35,119
Before Tajeddin Noyan's army moves..

16
00:03:35,120 --> 00:03:38,639
..we will quickly go to the
encampment and strike them.

17
00:03:39,080 --> 00:03:40,639
-Orhan Bey.
-My Bey.

18
00:03:40,640 --> 00:03:43,119
You will cover the left wing.

19
00:03:43,120 --> 00:03:45,119
As you command, Osman Bey.

20
00:03:45,120 --> 00:03:50,639
-Gunduz Bey, you will cover the right wing.
-Sure, Osman Bey.

21
00:03:50,640 --> 00:03:54,119
Even if we break Tajeddin Noyan's army..

22
00:03:54,600 --> 00:03:58,639
..Olcaytu Khan’s army will come.

23
00:03:59,600 --> 00:04:04,639
It is his nephew, Bey. He
will want to have us pay.

24
00:04:05,600 --> 00:04:09,639
Tajeddin Noyan has a lot to pay for, Boran Bey.

25
00:04:10,080 --> 00:04:14,639
However, we will think about it later.

26
00:04:14,640 --> 00:04:17,119
No. Do not worry.

27
00:04:17,600 --> 00:04:22,119
We will make a move for him now. However..

28
00:04:22,120 --> 00:04:25,119
We won't be alone in this.

29
00:04:25,120 --> 00:04:31,119
Of course, those with a burning
heart for war must be with us.

30
00:04:34,600 --> 00:04:36,639
It is a hard job, Osman Bey.

31
00:04:36,640 --> 00:04:40,639
Those who are tough can walk on the hard path.

32
00:04:41,600 --> 00:04:44,639
Do not worry. We will win with Allah's permission.

33
00:04:45,080 --> 00:04:47,119
-If Allah permits.
-If Allah permits.

34
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:49,119
-If Allah permits.
-However..

35
00:04:49,120 --> 00:04:53,119
..the enemy does not march only from the east.

36
00:04:54,080 --> 00:04:59,639
Now, the executioner of Rome
is about to come to our lands.

37
00:05:00,080 --> 00:05:02,639
-Bayindir Bey.
-My Bey.

38
00:05:02,640 --> 00:05:04,639
Go to the lords.

39
00:05:04,640 --> 00:05:08,119
Be sure again..

40
00:05:08,120 --> 00:05:11,119
..that they won’t bow down to anyone but us.

41
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:16,119
All of them will pay their taxes for this union.

42
00:05:17,080 --> 00:05:22,639
Do not worry, my Osman
Bey. I can have their loyalty..

43
00:05:22,640 --> 00:05:25,119
..and the tax by force if needed, for sure.

44
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:30,639
For sure. We will make our moves now..

45
00:05:30,640 --> 00:05:35,119
..however, the enemy won't just stand around.

46
00:05:36,080 --> 00:05:43,639
If we can't strike Tajeddin Noyan's
army, then he will come to Yenisehir.

47
00:05:46,080 --> 00:05:49,119
Bala Hatun. Take the kids and elderly..

48
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:52,119
...and get them out of the city before dawn.

49
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:55,119
Take them to the cave on the road to Kocakulak.

50
00:05:55,120 --> 00:06:00,119
As you command, my Bey. We will take precautions.

51
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:03,119
-Are we allowed, my Bey?
-Come in.

52
00:06:14,080 --> 00:06:19,119
Alaeddin? What happened, son?

53
00:06:20,080 --> 00:06:24,119
-My son?
-A hatun..

54
00:06:29,080 --> 00:06:33,639
..tried to kill me with this.

55
00:06:37,080 --> 00:06:39,639
A Tatar crossbow.

56
00:06:41,080 --> 00:06:43,639
And a Hatun..

57
00:06:57,080 --> 00:07:01,119
Are you alright?

58
00:07:01,120 --> 00:07:06,639
I am alright, my Bey.

59
00:07:08,600 --> 00:07:11,639
They hit Yakup Bey first..

60
00:07:12,080 --> 00:07:15,639
..now they hit you.

61
00:07:21,680 --> 00:07:24,679
TACETTIN NOYAN HEADQUARTERS

62
00:07:43,080 --> 00:07:47,639
So you're here. The war has started, Mehmed Bey.

63
00:07:48,080 --> 00:07:51,119
Seeing you by my side brought me joy.

64
00:07:51,120 --> 00:07:55,639
Osman crossed the line. He
will pay for what he has done.

65
00:07:56,080 --> 00:08:00,119
He will. We will make him pay together.

66
00:08:00,120 --> 00:08:05,119
However, I want you to do something.

67
00:08:06,080 --> 00:08:10,119
I want to see Osman at Frontier
Marketplace for the last time.

68
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:15,639
You will be a intermediary for that meeting.

69
00:08:16,080 --> 00:08:21,119
You're telling me the war has
started, and you still want to see him.

70
00:08:21,120 --> 00:08:24,639
-Why, Tajeddin Noyan?
-Because..

71
00:08:25,080 --> 00:08:31,639
..having Osman begging at my
feet brings more joy than his death.

72
00:08:32,080 --> 00:08:36,119
I have such a card in my hand..

73
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:40,119
.Osman will bow down to me sooner or later.

74
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:43,639
Don’t you want this as well?

75
00:08:46,600 --> 00:08:50,639
This move makes Germiyanids enemies to Kayis.

76
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:57,119
However, anything is worth seeing Osman bow down.

77
00:08:57,120 --> 00:09:02,639
You are on the right way,
Mehmed Bey. You will live long.

78
00:09:19,080 --> 00:09:23,639
How will I do this?

79
00:09:24,600 --> 00:09:27,639
My Allah, grant her healing.

80
00:09:28,600 --> 00:09:33,119
No, a wooden spoon. A wooden spoon..

81
00:09:37,600 --> 00:09:42,119
Hold on my Gonca.
Hold on, you are strong..

82
00:09:46,080 --> 00:09:50,119
In the name of Allah, the merciful,
the compassionate.

83
00:09:52,600 --> 00:09:57,639
The Healer! The Healer! The Healer!

84
00:10:11,880 --> 00:10:15,399
We checked with the ladies, my Bey.

85
00:10:15,440 --> 00:10:18,439
That Hatun is not Mongol.

86
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:21,919
She is Christian.

87
00:10:23,400 --> 00:10:29,919
These are her clothes.
Similar to what we saw today.

88
00:10:34,880 --> 00:10:40,919
That is the arrow shot Yakup Bey..

89
00:10:41,880 --> 00:10:45,919
..and these are the arrows we
found on her, they are the same.

90
00:10:55,880 --> 00:10:59,439
The arrows match.

91
00:10:59,440 --> 00:11:03,919
They are the same, however,
I feel something is wrong.

92
00:11:06,880 --> 00:11:10,919
This is a Tatar crossbow. This
is not a crusader made bow.

93
00:11:11,880 --> 00:11:16,439
They tried to do Mongol artisanship.
However, look at the string.

94
00:11:26,400 --> 00:11:29,919
Crusaders use silk for strings, my Bey.

95
00:11:32,400 --> 00:11:37,439
This is Mongol string. Made from intestines.

96
00:11:38,500 --> 00:11:41,139
Intestines you say..

97
00:11:47,880 --> 00:11:52,439
They tried to frame Mongol
crossbow as crusader-made, is that so?

98
00:11:52,880 --> 00:11:54,919
Are they playing tricks on us, my Bey?

99
00:11:54,920 --> 00:11:58,919
It seems they're trying to confuse us.

100
00:12:00,880 --> 00:12:05,439
First, Yakup Bey. Then, Alaeddin..

101
00:12:09,400 --> 00:12:12,919
This issue will be a big one.

102
00:12:14,400 --> 00:12:19,919
They didn't think we would find her,
they only thought we would find the arrow.

103
00:12:19,920 --> 00:12:23,919
Now, we have a Tatar crossbow.

104
00:12:25,420 --> 00:12:30,439
According to them, we were going
to hold Mongols responsible..

105
00:12:31,880 --> 00:12:34,919
It is someone who tries to ensure our aim, my Bey.

106
00:12:35,400 --> 00:12:41,439
This could only benefit the Executioner of Rome.

107
00:12:49,400 --> 00:12:52,439
The gorgeous Princess Maria.

108
00:12:52,440 --> 00:12:58,439
Finally, we've met. The unity
of llhanids and Byzantine..

109
00:12:58,880 --> 00:13:02,919
..will be realized thanks to our wedding.

110
00:13:02,920 --> 00:13:06,439
This is a very important matter.

111
00:13:06,440 --> 00:13:12,919
I am aware, Tajeddin Noyan.
And I am quite happy for it.

112
00:13:12,920 --> 00:13:16,919
You can be sure that I will
be a loyal partner to you.

113
00:13:16,920 --> 00:13:20,919
Everything for the well-being of the two states.

114
00:13:25,880 --> 00:13:27,439
-Kanyumaz.
-My Bey.

115
00:13:27,440 --> 00:13:30,439
Go to Yenisehir and send word to Osman.

116
00:13:30,880 --> 00:13:34,919
Tajeddin Noyan wants to
talk with Osman in our tribe.

117
00:13:34,920 --> 00:13:37,919
-His intention is to make peace.
-As you command, my Bey.

118
00:13:38,400 --> 00:13:41,919
Send word to Cerkutay. Tell him
to prepare Frontier Marketplace.

119
00:13:41,920 --> 00:13:46,439
I want a welcoming that deserves
someone like Tajeddin Noyan.

120
00:14:03,880 --> 00:14:06,919
Who is this? Do you know, Kanyumaz?

121
00:14:06,920 --> 00:14:09,919
I don't, my Bey. He is a stranger.

122
00:14:39,400 --> 00:14:44,439
Princess Maria. How good it is to see you.

123
00:14:44,440 --> 00:14:46,439
congratulate you again.

124
00:14:46,440 --> 00:14:51,439
You didn’t come here to just
congratulate, right Imren “Pegin?

125
00:14:52,400 --> 00:14:57,919
I've heard what happened with
Osman. I told you, Tajeddin Noyan..

126
00:14:58,400 --> 00:15:00,919
..Osman would never bow to you.

127
00:15:01,400 --> 00:15:05,439
Neither in a cage nor in a forest.

128
00:15:05,880 --> 00:15:08,879
You only lost time.

129
00:15:08,920 --> 00:15:12,439
Now, you do not have
any other option but to fight.

130
00:15:12,880 --> 00:15:16,919
We tried the way of peace first.

131
00:15:17,880 --> 00:15:24,919
The wrath of merciful men..

132
00:15:24,920 --> 00:15:28,919
..are greater than their mercy, Imren Tegin.

133
00:15:29,400 --> 00:15:34,439
Soon, you will witness a big bloodbath.

134
00:15:34,440 --> 00:15:39,439
I will take Osman's life in Yakup's tribe.

135
00:15:39,440 --> 00:15:41,919
And that stupid son of his..

136
00:15:41,920 --> 00:15:45,919
..will serve me without knowing.

137
00:15:45,920 --> 00:15:50,959
Then, we will make that..

138
00:15:51,880 --> 00:15:56,439
..grand wedding with Princess Maria.

139
00:15:56,880 --> 00:16:02,439
Until then, you will wait for me
at the palace in Konya, Princess.

140
00:16:02,880 --> 00:16:05,439
Now, it is time to go.

141
00:16:05,440 --> 00:16:08,439
When we get rid of Osman..

142
00:16:08,440 --> 00:16:11,439
..our wedding will have more meaning.

143
00:16:11,440 --> 00:16:15,919
I will wait for you with patience, Tajeddin Noyan.

144
00:16:21,880 --> 00:16:26,919
You know what they say, ’’May
Allah unites you two together”, Noyan.

145
00:16:27,400 --> 00:16:29,919
Osman's death benefits me the most.

146
00:16:30,400 --> 00:16:33,439
-If you need help..
-There is no need.

147
00:16:33,440 --> 00:16:36,919
I don't want mercenaries at my side.

148
00:16:37,240 --> 00:16:43,279
Alright. I hope you will
be enough to do all of that.

149
00:16:43,400 --> 00:16:46,919
Tajeddin Noyan.

150
00:16:58,880 --> 00:17:00,919
Tajeddin tricked Mehmed Bey.

151
00:17:00,920 --> 00:17:03,919
They will kill Osman Bey at Yakup Bey's tribe.

152
00:17:04,400 --> 00:17:08,439
They set up a trap, let him know.

153
00:17:12,400 --> 00:17:16,439
Come on!

154
00:17:39,400 --> 00:17:42,919
Now we'll go to hit Tajedding
Noyan's army quickly.

155
00:17:42,920 --> 00:17:47,439
Everybody knows well what
to do. Our target is his tent.

156
00:17:49,880 --> 00:17:56,919
After we take Tajeddin's head, we will
figure out what to do with his headless army.

157
00:17:58,400 --> 00:18:03,439
Osman Bey, I got a message from my alps.

158
00:18:03,440 --> 00:18:06,919
They're on the way. I wish we could wait for them.

159
00:18:07,400 --> 00:18:11,919
If we had the Kayi warri the Kayi warriors
of the east, we would be stronger in fight.

160
00:18:12,400 --> 00:18:15,919
No, Gunduz Bey. What if
Tajeddin Noyan's army comes..

161
00:18:15,920 --> 00:18:19,919
...by the time we wait for your alps?

162
00:18:20,880 --> 00:18:25,439
We'd be a thousand more but
they'd be ten thousands more then.

163
00:18:26,880 --> 00:18:32,439
I can't take that risk. We will
attack Tajeddin Noyan's army today.

164
00:18:48,880 --> 00:18:52,439
Osman Bey, I’ve brought a message from Mehmed Bey.

165
00:18:52,440 --> 00:18:55,439
-What is it?
-Tajeddin Noya

166
00:18:55,880 --> 00:19:00,439
..wants to negotiate with you in the frontier
market with Mehmed Bey as the reconciler.

167
00:19:00,880 --> 00:19:03,919
A last meeting for peace, Osman Bey.

168
00:19:17,880 --> 00:19:20,919
Tell Mehmed Bey...

169
00:19:22,400 --> 00:19:26,919
-I'll let him know my decision tonight.
-As you order, Osman Bey.

170
00:19:33,400 --> 00:19:36,919
Osman Bey, don't you go there

171
00:19:37,440 --> 00:19:41,919
-That dog is laying a trap.
-Don't worry, Gunduz Bey.

172
00:19:41,920 --> 00:19:44,439
Don’t worry.

173
00:19:45,400 --> 00:19:49,439
If I were sure, I'd say we would be there.

174
00:19:50,400 --> 00:19:53,919
Of course, he is trying to lay a trap.

175
00:20:04,400 --> 00:20:07,439
My Bey, we got a message, from Princess Maria.

176
00:20:07,880 --> 00:20:11,919
Tajeddin Noyan's invitation is a trap.

177
00:20:12,880 --> 00:20:17,439
Two
Well... Now I'm sure.

178
00:20:20,880 --> 00:20:26,919
Yet something bothers my mind.

179
00:20:29,880 --> 00:20:34,439
Is Mehmed Bey involved in this trap?

180
00:20:35,880 --> 00:20:39,919
He deceived him. He thinks he’ll really negotiate.

181
00:20:42,880 --> 00:20:46,919
I'd never rather kill my own kin.

182
00:20:47,400 --> 00:20:52,439
Well, Gunduz Bey... We were going to hunt.

183
00:20:52,440 --> 00:20:56,439
But the hunt is coming to me now.

184
00:20:58,400 --> 00:21:04,439
Songur Agha, go to Tajeddin
Noyan's prisoner camp with your alps.

185
00:21:04,440 --> 00:21:09,439
While we take his head in the frontier
market, you’ll save the prisoners.

186
00:21:09,440 --> 00:21:11,919
As you order, my Bey.

187
00:21:12,400 --> 00:21:15,919
Let's go, alps!

188
00:21:18,400 --> 00:21:20,439
-Bayindir Bey.
-My Bey.

189
00:21:20,440 --> 00:21:22,919
We'll keep the promise we gave Princess Maria.

190
00:21:23,400 --> 00:21:27,439
Before we go to Atronos, set her free.

191
00:21:27,440 --> 00:21:30,439
Consider it done, my Bey.

192
00:21:30,880 --> 00:21:33,919
I will make Princess come together with her lover.

193
00:21:34,240 --> 00:21:37,799
Thank you. Boran

194
00:21:38,240 --> 00:21:42,279
Send the fastest horse to the
frontier market. Let Cerkutay know.

195
00:21:42,280 --> 00:21:46,279
-Tell him to prepare all the alps.
-As my Bey orders.

196
00:21:46,760 --> 00:21:52,799
We're making a move but
we should still be cautious.

197
00:21:53,240 --> 00:21:57,279
Alaaddin and his alps will protect the palace.

198
00:21:57,760 --> 00:22:00,799
Come on, alps!
Everybody on horses!

199
00:22:00,800 --> 00:22:06,279
We will cut off Tajeddin Noyan's head today.

200
00:22:09,760 --> 00:22:13,279
Gunduz Bey

201
00:22:17,760 --> 00:22:21,279
You aren't going to kill that
dog without me, are you?

202
00:22:21,760 --> 00:22:24,799
We have an account to settle.

203
00:22:35,240 --> 00:22:40,279
They're from Hayme Mother's blood. I
wouldn't expect them to do otherwise.

204
00:22:46,700 --> 00:22:48,899
Come on!

205
00:23:07,240 --> 00:23:11,279
-Come on!
-Giddap!

206
00:23:19,760 --> 00:23:22,279
-My Shahzade.
-Baysungur, what is the situation?

207
00:23:22,280 --> 00:23:24,799
The same, my Shahzade.

208
00:23:24,800 --> 00:23:27,279
Ulgen Hatun is working inside.

209
00:23:27,760 --> 00:23:31,799
Baysungur, I'm here. You go.
Let me know if anybody calls me.

210
00:23:32,240 --> 00:23:34,799
-Come on.
-Let's go.

211
00:23:42,240 --> 00:23:44,799
I'm here, Gonca.

212
00:23:47,240 --> 00:23:51,799
-This is not working. Her fever isn’t going down
-Hold on, Gonca.

213
00:23:52,240 --> 00:23:57,799
You'll fere alright.
You will be alright.

214
00:24:00,240 --> 00:24:02,799
My Shahzade, we should
talk to Bala Hatun at least.

215
00:24:03,240 --> 00:24:06,799
No, Ulgen Hatun. Neither of my parents will know.

216
00:24:07,240 --> 00:24:10,799
I came here at the cost of
my life despite my brother.

217
00:24:11,760 --> 00:24:14,279
Although I know he'll kill me.

218
00:24:14,280 --> 00:24:16,799
If they find out,

219
00:24:16,800 --> 00:24:21,799
...they will send Gonca to
Mehmed. And Mehmed will kill her.

220
00:24:25,240 --> 00:24:27,799
Alaaddin...

221
00:24:33,240 --> 00:24:36,799
I'm here. I'm here.

222
00:24:38,760 --> 00:24:41,279
You'll be alright.

223
00:24:43,240 --> 00:24:46,799
In the name of Allah, the merciful,
the compassionate.

224
00:24:59,240 --> 00:25:02,279
We need ice. Keep applying vinegar on her.

225
00:25:02,760 --> 00:25:05,279
I'll go send some alps to find cure.

226
00:25:16,240 --> 00:25:17,799
Mother, it's me!

227
00:25:25,240 --> 00:25:26,279
he sees Gonca, we can’t stop him.

228
00:25:26,280 --> 00:25:29,799
We can't let Ghazi, Ulgen Hatun. If
he sees Gonca, we can't stop him.

229
00:25:30,240 --> 00:25:34,799
Mother, it's me. Why is this door stuck?

230
00:25:35,760 --> 00:25:39,279
-What will we do?
-What will we do?

231
00:25:43,760 --> 00:25:47,279
Don’t push the door. I’m sick.

232
00:25:47,280 --> 00:25:52,279
Open the door then; Let me check
you. I'm supposed to look after you.

233
00:25:52,760 --> 00:25:55,279
No, I can't! It's contagious.

234
00:25:55,760 --> 00:25:59,799
Go away! And do come back until I recover.

235
00:25:59,800 --> 00:26:04,799
Since my father left, she's got worse. My Allah...

236
00:26:10,240 --> 00:26:14,799
He's gone.

237
00:26:44,760 --> 00:26:51,279
Alaaddin isn't dead, huh?
Osman will get suspicious.

238
00:26:51,760 --> 00:26:55,279
We will meet very soon.

239
00:26:56,240 --> 00:27:00,279
But I will be the one pulling
the strings in the meeting.

240
00:27:00,760 --> 00:27:03,799
I will kill...

241
00:27:03,800 --> 00:27:08,279
...emperor's beloved pretty
daughter Princess Maria...

242
00:27:11,240 --> 00:27:13,799
...and put the blame on Osman.

243
00:27:13,800 --> 00:27:16,279
What about Tajeddin Noyan?

244
00:27:16,760 --> 00:27:20,279
The emperor will declare war against
Osman for killing his daughter...

245
00:27:20,280 --> 00:27:23,799
...and against Mongolians
for failing to protect her.

246
00:27:23,800 --> 00:27:27,279
And I'll be the only ruler in
these lands during the chaos.

247
00:27:28,240 --> 00:27:31,279
And you’ll be the servants of this power.

248
00:27:31,760 --> 00:27:37,799
Benjamin, the route? Daniel,
did you lay traps on the road?

249
00:27:39,240 --> 00:27:46,279
Levi, are the soldiers to destroy
Mongolian convoy going to Konya ready?

250
00:27:46,760 --> 00:27:49,279
Good.

251
00:27:52,760 --> 00:27:55,799
You look like you gained a victory, Imren Tegin.

252
00:27:56,760 --> 00:27:59,799
I will. So you will.

253
00:28:01,760 --> 00:28:05,799
For a long time, we've been only losing.

254
00:28:06,760 --> 00:28:11,279
Roman Lords are paying taxes to a Turk.

255
00:28:11,760 --> 00:28:15,799
One of Osman’s Beys, Bayindir.

256
00:28:16,240 --> 00:28:20,279
He's coming to collect taxes tomorrow.

257
00:28:20,760 --> 00:28:23,799
He'll come to collect taxes and deliver his life.

258
00:28:24,240 --> 00:28:27,279
Don't. Imren Tegin.

259
00:28:27,280 --> 00:28:32,799
If you harm Osman's man, you'll
draw him over you completely.

260
00:28:33,760 --> 00:28:37,799
Emperor sent me here to destroy Osman.

261
00:28:38,760 --> 00:28:42,279
I'll separate him from his
pack and draw him to me.

262
00:28:42,760 --> 00:28:46,279
And with only one move, I
will wipe his name off the world.

263
00:28:46,760 --> 00:28:50,799
I mean... That’s already what I want, Olivia.

264
00:28:52,760 --> 00:28:56,799
Benjamin, Daniel, Levi. We are going.

265
00:28:57,240 --> 00:29:01,799
-Where are we going now?
-To reinforce the alliance of Rome and Mongolians.

266
00:29:04,720 --> 00:29:07,719
GERMIYANOGLU BORDER - FRONTIER MARKET

267
00:29:29,240 --> 00:29:32,279
Come here, dastard.

268
00:29:32,280 --> 00:29:35,799
Your death is awaiting you inside.

269
00:30:11,480 --> 00:30:14,519
Welcome, Tajeddin Noyan.
-Thank you.

270
00:31:08,480 --> 00:31:11,039
Welcome.

271
00:31:11,480 --> 00:31:15,039
Tajeddin Noyan.

272
00:31:25,480 --> 00:31:29,519
-An eye for an eye, huh, Osman Bey?
-Not yet.

273
00:31:30,000 --> 00:31:33,039
The retaliation is not over yet.

274
00:31:33,480 --> 00:31:37,519
What are you doing here? Osman Bey?

275
00:31:38,000 --> 00:31:42,039
I invited you for peace. But you
are using my tent for your revenge.

276
00:31:42,040 --> 00:31:45,039
Peace is made with honorable people.

277
00:31:45,040 --> 00:31:48,519
Not with dishonourable people like him.

278
00:31:49,000 --> 00:31:55,519
You wanted to kill me.
You used Mehmet for this.

279
00:31:57,000 --> 00:32:04,039
But... I learned that
beforehand and took precautions.

280
00:32:04,480 --> 00:32:08,039
Osman Bey is right, Mehmet Bey.

281
00:32:09,000 --> 00:32:12,519
My intention is to kill him here...

282
00:32:13,000 --> 00:32:17,519
...and stop him from injuring the Alps.

283
00:32:19,480 --> 00:32:23,039
He is the head of the rebels.

284
00:32:24,480 --> 00:32:27,519
You wanted to kill me.

285
00:32:27,520 --> 00:32:33,039
You used Mehmet. You wanted
to turn brothers into enemies.

286
00:32:33,480 --> 00:32:38,519
But I informed Alps beforehand..

287
00:32:40,000 --> 00:32:43,519
...and took precautions.

288
00:32:44,480 --> 00:32:47,519
Is Osman Bey telling the truth, Tajeddin?

289
00:32:55,000 --> 00:32:59,039
Do you think you can stop me?

290
00:33:01,000 --> 00:33:06,039
Besides... how do you know?

291
00:33:06,040 --> 00:33:09,039
Princess Maria, who was going to be your...

292
00:33:09,480 --> 00:33:14,519
...Hatun, told us everything.

293
00:33:16,480 --> 00:33:20,039
What happened, Tajeddin Noyan?

294
00:33:22,000 --> 00:33:26,519
You were going for hunting,
but now you became the prey.

295
00:33:49,480 --> 00:33:53,039
Stop there.

296
00:33:57,480 --> 00:33:59,319
Where are you going, huh

297
00:33:59,320 --> 00:34:01,039
Where are you going, huh?

298
00:34:01,480 --> 00:34:05,519
-Trap!
-Alps!

299
00:35:22,000 --> 00:35:26,519
Allah is the Greatest!

300
00:35:31,480 --> 00:35:37,039
Death is haram for me before I take my people's
revenge from you! Come at me, dastards!

301
00:36:07,000 --> 00:36:11,519
Close the doors!

302
00:36:13,000 --> 00:36:20,519
Let him run! We have the owner
of the dog. We will catch him for sure.

303
00:36:23,480 --> 00:36:26,519
Ayse Hatun!

304
00:36:45,000 --> 00:36:47,519
Until today, we didn't have a Bey's son behind us.

305
00:36:47,520 --> 00:36:51,519
Don’t worry, we know how to defend ourselves.

306
00:36:52,480 --> 00:36:57,039
If I hadn’t arrived on time, I would
have seen what you do and don't know.

307
00:37:03,000 --> 00:37:06,039
What did you gain by...

308
00:37:06,040 --> 00:37:09,519
...trapping me here, Osman Bey?

309
00:37:10,000 --> 00:37:16,039
Do you think you can shed the
blood of the llkhanate dynasty?

310
00:37:16,040 --> 00:37:20,899
Just as you couldn't do anything to Geyhatu
back then ...

311
00:37:21,000 --> 00:37:24,519
...you won't be able to
do anything to me either, Osman Bey.

312
00:37:24,520 --> 00:37:27,039
What will belonging to the
dynasty of Olcaytu Khan...

313
00:37:27,480 --> 00:37:31,039
...change after all you've done?

314
00:37:31,040 --> 00:37:34,039
Do you think you can escape?

315
00:37:34,480 --> 00:37:39,519
I called you for peace, but
you involved me in your fight.

316
00:37:39,520 --> 00:37:42,039
I will hold you
accountable for this.

317
00:37:42,040 --> 00:37:45,519
The one you should hold
accountable is standing before you.

318
00:37:46,480 --> 00:37:48,519
But he won't be able to leave here.

319
00:37:48,520 --> 00:37:52,039
Do you want to face Mongols who conquered China...

320
00:37:52,480 --> 00:37:57,039
...India, and Anatolia by killing me, huh?

321
00:37:57,480 --> 00:38:02,039
Your dreams bigger than
yourself will be destroyed.

322
00:38:03,000 --> 00:38:07,039
You can only be our servants.

323
00:38:08,480 --> 00:38:14,519
For each drop of my blood, a thousand
men of yours will die, Osman Bey.

324
00:38:25,000 --> 00:38:28,519
Is that so, huh?

325
00:38:32,480 --> 00:38:36,519
Don’t you dare Osman Bey...

326
00:38:36,520 --> 00:38:39,039
Stop there...

327
00:38:40,000 --> 00:38:44,039
Stop there... You can't even imagine..

328
00:38:46,000 --> 00:38:52,519
...the things I dare.

329
00:38:53,480 --> 00:38:56,039
Now...

330
00:38:58,480 --> 00:39:03,039
I will bury you, your heirs...

331
00:39:03,440 --> 00:39:07,479
...and the dogs that cause fitna and follow you...

332
00:39:07,480 --> 00:39:10,479
...all in these lands.

333
00:39:11,440 --> 00:39:15,279
Don’t you do that... Don't you do that!

334
00:39:15,280 --> 00:39:17,799
Your power...

335
00:39:17,800 --> 00:39:20,799
...is nothing against my will.

336
00:39:20,800 --> 00:39:24,319
You wash blood with blood, Osman.

337
00:39:24,640 --> 00:39:27,679
Is that so?

338
00:39:28,160 --> 00:39:33,199
Then you should know, too much blood will be shed.

339
00:39:33,760 --> 00:39:38,799
Too much blood will be washed with blood.

340
00:40:29,280 --> 00:40:35,319
My Bey... Thanks to Allah, we took
all the nokers down at the marketplace.

341
00:40:35,320 --> 00:40:38,319
Thank you, thank you.

342
00:40:46,120 --> 00:40:48,679
You did all those things...

343
00:40:51,200 --> 00:40:56,239
But... you will still die under my sword.

344
00:40:57,280 --> 00:41:02,319
Worse things will happen to you, Osman.

345
00:41:02,320 --> 00:41:05,799
The horses coming for revenge
will trample your homeland.

346
00:41:06,080 --> 00:41:10,119
For years, there will be
no crops, no flowing waters.

347
00:41:10,120 --> 00:41:15,159
You are nothing now, Osman!

348
00:41:15,760 --> 00:41:19,799
You are neither the first nor...

349
00:41:19,800 --> 00:41:22,319
...the last to say this to us.

350
00:41:23,920 --> 00:41:27,959
But as you say that we are going to be destroyed..

351
00:41:28,760 --> 00:41:32,799
...we will always exist!

352
00:41:38,600 --> 00:41:41,119
Stand up...

353
00:41:41,760 --> 00:41:47,319
Those properties which belong to you
now will be ours soon with Allah’s consent.

354
00:41:48,760 --> 00:41:54,319
Your sultanate of cruelty will be destroyed.

355
00:41:54,320 --> 00:41:58,799
We will crush all the unrest you caused...

356
00:41:58,800 --> 00:42:01,319
...and establish this state.

357
00:42:01,320 --> 00:42:11,799
Long live Osman Bey!
Long live Osman Bey!

358
00:42:13,280 --> 00:42:18,319
I thought you were smart,
that’s why I came for peace.

359
00:42:18,320 --> 00:42:20,799
But you...

360
00:42:21,280 --> 00:42:25,319
...are a dreamer who has impossible dreams!

361
00:42:25,320 --> 00:42:29,319
If you ignore the truth..

362
00:42:29,320 --> 00:42:34,319
...you will think it is not real for sure.

363
00:42:37,000 --> 00:42:43,039
This plane tree will rise slowly, gradually.

364
00:42:44,280 --> 00:42:48,799
Tajeddin Noyan, when you can’t see the sun...

365
00:42:49,760 --> 00:42:54,799
...you'll understand how great the state is.

366
00:42:55,280 --> 00:42:58,319
This sun will burn you!

367
00:42:58,320 --> 00:43:03,319
The llkhanate will make you live in hell.

368
00:43:04,280 --> 00:43:07,799
All of you will die!

369
00:43:08,280 --> 00:43:14,799
You will disappear under Osman's dreams!

370
00:43:16,440 --> 00:43:19,479
You have oppressed us, Tajeddin Noyan.

371
00:43:19,760 --> 00:43:24,319
This is really salvation for you.

372
00:43:25,760 --> 00:43:30,319
The revenge of my mother
and my brother will be taken...

373
00:43:30,320 --> 00:43:33,319
...now I won’t worry about anything even if I die.

374
00:43:33,320 --> 00:43:38,319
My husband's murderer,
dog... You will die like a dog.

375
00:43:41,760 --> 00:43:46,799
No one will disappear because of those dreams.

376
00:43:46,800 --> 00:43:49,319
But you..

377
00:43:50,280 --> 00:43:54,319
You and those like you...

378
00:43:54,320 --> 00:43:58,319
...you will all disappear.

379
00:44:32,760 --> 00:44:38,799
We will always be here!

380
00:44:39,760 --> 00:44:42,799
When they come to take
their revenge... ill always be

381
00:44:42,800 --> 00:44:48,319
...we will always be the wall
that protects our people!

382
00:44:48,760 --> 00:44:54,319
Like a clenched fist, we will
always fight for the glorification...

383
00:44:54,760 --> 00:44:59,799
...of the word of Allah
and the order of the world!

384
00:45:01,760 --> 00:45:05,319
Now tell me... Will you be with me...

385
00:45:05,320 --> 00:45:08,319
...in this cause of existing here?

386
00:45:08,760 --> 00:45:10,799
We will!

387
00:45:10,800 --> 00:45:17,319
-Will you?
-We will!

388
00:45:17,760 --> 00:45:21,319
Praise be!

389
00:45:29,280 --> 00:45:34,799
My Bey... The captives from Gunduz Bey's tribe
bum were saved. They are coming to Yenisehir.

390
00:45:34,800 --> 00:45:39,319
So you are saying we have good news. Gunduz Bey!

391
00:45:41,280 --> 00:45:46,799
All prisoners at the headquarters were
saved. They are coming to Yenisehir.

392
00:45:47,760 --> 00:45:52,319
You gave me the good news
after taking Tajeddin's head...

393
00:45:52,760 --> 00:45:57,319
...thank you, thank you, Osman Bey!

394
00:46:02,280 --> 00:46:07,799
Thank you. Now two Kayis will unite in Yenisehir.

395
00:46:07,800 --> 00:46:11,319
And when we unite, we will be
the wrist which cannot be defeated.

396
00:46:11,320 --> 00:46:14,799
It wouldn’t suit us otherwise.

397
00:46:18,760 --> 00:46:20,319
-Boran.
-My Bey.

398
00:46:20,320 --> 00:46:23,319
Alps will be after Noyan's helper Abdulkasim.

399
00:46:23,320 --> 00:46:27,799
-We have many things to learn from him.
-Yes my Bey..

400
00:46:28,760 --> 00:46:31,799
Put that dog’s head..

401
00:46:32,280 --> 00:46:36,319
...on a magnificent tray
and show it to all tribes..

402
00:46:36,320 --> 00:46:41,799
Show it, then all the tribes
will hear about our victory.

403
00:46:42,280 --> 00:46:46,799
It's time to instill trust in
friends and fear in enemies.

404
00:46:46,800 --> 00:46:52,319
Long live Osman Bey!
Long live Osman Bey!

405
00:48:05,760 --> 00:48:10,799
We'll take the princess without
being seen by these dogs.

406
00:48:11,280 --> 00:48:14,319
No one will be able to blame us for this.

407
00:48:14,320 --> 00:48:20,319
Come on... Alps!
You will protect us.

408
00:48:33,760 --> 00:48:38,799
Princess! -Bayindir Bey!
-I came to save you from these dogs. Come on.

409
00:48:54,760 --> 00:48:56,799
Who are they, Bayindir Bey?

410
00:48:56,800 --> 00:49:00,799
Apparently... there are
others who want the Princess.

411
00:49:00,800 --> 00:49:05,319
We have no time to learn. Come on. Come on.

412
00:49:28,760 --> 00:49:32,319
Where is the Princess?

413
00:49:34,760 --> 00:49:37,319
In the cart.

414
00:49:44,760 --> 00:49:48,319
Osman!

415
00:49:51,280 --> 00:49:53,701
What are we going to do now?

416
00:49:53,713 --> 00:49:55,799
This changed my plans.

417
00:49:58,760 --> 00:50:02,799
Send news to the Emperor. Osman...

418
00:50:02,800 --> 00:50:09,319
...killed his
dear daughter Princess Maria.

419
00:50:17,760 --> 00:50:22,799
Alps will take you to Konya, to your beloved one.

420
00:50:22,800 --> 00:50:25,799
My Osman Bey prepared everything.

421
00:50:25,800 --> 00:50:32,319
I am grateful! May God protect
you and give power to Osman Bey.

422
00:50:32,320 --> 00:50:37,799
If Allah permits.
Alps... Apparently...

423
00:50:37,800 --> 00:50:40,799
...there are other people after the Princess.

424
00:50:40,800 --> 00:50:42,319
Be careful.

425
00:50:42,320 --> 00:50:46,319
-Yes my Bey.
-Yes my Bey.

426
00:50:46,440 --> 00:50:48,999
Go now.

427
00:51:02,280 --> 00:51:07,799
Come here. Send news to Osman Bey.

428
00:51:08,280 --> 00:51:12,799
We took the Princess safely. Go.

429
00:51:15,280 --> 00:51:17,799
-Kara Ali.
-My Bey.

430
00:51:17,800 --> 00:51:21,319
We are going to Atranos. Come oni

431
00:51:28,040 --> 00:51:35,079
Long live Osman Bey!
Long live Osman Bey!

432
00:52:20,640 --> 00:52:23,159
Bala.

433
00:52:23,640 --> 00:52:27,679
-Son.
-May your victory be blessed, my Bey.

434
00:52:28,120 --> 00:52:31,159
-Thank you.
-Tajeddin got the death he deserved.

435
00:52:31,160 --> 00:52:35,679
-He vanished before his evil spread.
-Yes.

436
00:52:35,680 --> 00:52:39,679
We cut off his head with his evil soul.

437
00:52:40,640 --> 00:52:46,159
Well, there comes good after every evil.

438
00:52:48,640 --> 00:52:51,679
It brought our brothers to us.

439
00:52:55,120 --> 00:53:00,679
Bala Hatun, prepare good meals for
us in honor of getting rid of this trouble.

440
00:53:00,680 --> 00:53:04,679
So we can strengthen our brotherhood.

441
00:53:05,640 --> 00:53:07,159
Thank you, Osman Bey.

442
00:53:07,160 --> 00:53:12,159
The dog called Tajeddin standing
against our unity has been eliminated.

443
00:53:12,640 --> 00:53:16,159
Now can be more united and stronger.

444
00:53:16,640 --> 00:53:19,159
For sure, we will.

445
00:53:19,160 --> 00:53:22,159
Not only Kayi people but also everybody...

446
00:53:22,160 --> 00:53:24,679
...breathed a sigh of relief with his death.

447
00:53:24,680 --> 00:53:27,159
Thanks to Allah.

448
00:53:28,120 --> 00:53:33,679
-Thanks to Allah.
-Come on then. Let's go.

449
00:53:41,640 --> 00:53:47,679
Well... Our lands in the west are quite fertile,

450
00:53:47,680 --> 00:53:51,159
...safe and close to the water. For this reason,

451
00:53:51,640 --> 00:53:55,159
...you can settle in here with your tribe.

452
00:53:55,160 --> 00:54:00,159
No, Osman Bey. I know you're trying to protect me.

453
00:54:00,160 --> 00:54:03,679
But I want to pay off.

454
00:54:04,640 --> 00:54:08,159
I want the farthest land in the east.

455
00:54:08,160 --> 00:54:13,159
So I can fight first when Mongolians come.

456
00:54:14,120 --> 00:54:16,679
No.

457
00:54:17,120 --> 00:54:20,679
You have nothing to pay for.

458
00:54:21,120 --> 00:54:24,159
Brothers are no burdens for each ether.

459
00:54:25,120 --> 00:54:29,159
You can settle in here if you like. But...

460
00:54:30,640 --> 00:54:34,159
..I still want you beside me in Yenisehir.

461
00:54:34,160 --> 00:54:37,159
With pleasure, Osman Bey.

462
00:54:37,800 --> 00:54:40,159
So... Tell me.

463
00:54:40,640 --> 00:54:45,159
’’Fight never waits. Where are we marching next?

464
00:54:49,640 --> 00:54:52,679
Our target is always the same.

465
00:54:55,120 --> 00:54:58,159
Bursa on one side.

466
00:54:59,120 --> 00:55:02,679
And Iznik on the other.

467
00:55:04,120 --> 00:55:08,679
The enemy will do their best
to stop us from capturing them.

468
00:55:08,680 --> 00:55:14,159
But, with Allah’s will, our
dreams are going to con true.

469
00:55:14,640 --> 00:55:18,159
The way to rule the whole world...

470
00:55:19,120 --> 00:55:22,679
...is going through Bursa.

471
00:55:27,120 --> 00:55:29,679
It snows for 40 days.

472
00:55:30,120 --> 00:55:32,679
But we hunt one day.

473
00:55:34,640 --> 00:55:40,159
With Allah's will, Bursa will
also be conquered one day.

474
00:55:48,120 --> 00:55:51,679
Tell me.

475
00:55:52,120 --> 00:55:55,679
You are lost in thoughts. What is in your mind?

476
00:55:56,640 --> 00:55:59,159
What can it be, Osman Bey?

477
00:55:59,160 --> 00:56:04,679
Apart from the unity and welfare of
Kayi people, what can I think about?

478
00:56:05,640 --> 00:56:08,159
I share your dreams now.

479
00:56:08,640 --> 00:56:11,159
When your draw your sword,

480
00:56:11,160 --> 00:56:14,679
...our swords will be drawn too.

481
00:56:15,640 --> 00:56:20,679
Thank you, thank you, thank you.

482
00:56:20,680 --> 00:56:23,159
Thank you, Gunduz Bey.

483
00:56:23,160 --> 00:56:26,679
Thank you, Osman Bey.

484
00:56:30,650 --> 00:56:35,159
Thanks to Allah, we got rid of this trouble too.

485
00:56:36,120 --> 00:56:41,679
Osman Bey and his house
o played a great part in this.

486
00:56:41,680 --> 00:56:44,159
Yes.

487
00:56:44,160 --> 00:56:48,679
Both their women and men are so brave.

488
00:56:49,120 --> 00:56:54,679
Especially what they did during your
absence. Their help was priceless.

489
00:56:56,120 --> 00:57:01,679
Well... Orhan Bey... I first saw him with you.

490
00:57:02,120 --> 00:57:04,679
He helped a lot, didn't he?

491
00:57:05,120 --> 00:57:10,159
Thankfully. He looks like a
benevolent and good man.

492
00:57:12,120 --> 00:57:15,679
He is also very brave.

493
00:57:25,120 --> 00:57:32,159
He is. Praise be. May Allah help him, though.

494
00:57:34,120 --> 00:57:37,679
The woman he loves is a Lord's daughter.

495
00:57:37,680 --> 00:57:41,679
I saw her. She's beautiful.

496
00:57:43,640 --> 00:57:48,159
It doesn't matter. Nothing can
stand against him if he loves her.

497
00:57:48,160 --> 00:57:52,159
-May Allah help them come together.
-Yes.

498
00:57:52,160 --> 00:57:55,159
Hope the best.

499
00:58:22,280 --> 00:58:23,159
Thank you, Bala Hatun. It's like a true feast.

500
00:58:23,160 --> 00:58:25,719
Thank you, Bala Hatun. It’s like a true feast.

501
00:58:26,640 --> 00:58:31,679
It's a feast, in fact an important
day for you, Ayca Hatun.

502
00:58:33,640 --> 00:58:38,159
Yes. My hatun, my brave son..

503
00:58:38,160 --> 00:58:41,679
...and the martyrs have been avenged.

504
00:58:53,120 --> 00:58:59,159
Well, everybody is here. Welcome.

505
00:59:01,640 --> 00:59:06,679
Fatma Hatun, look who is here.

506
00:59:17,120 --> 00:59:21,679
-Good evening.
-Mother.

507
00:59:29,120 --> 00:59:35,679
-Didn't you go?
-I delayed my journey for an important duty.

508
00:59:43,120 --> 00:59:46,679
-Son.
-Mother.

509
00:59:48,120 --> 00:59:52,159
-Welcome, mother.
-Thanks.

510
00:59:53,120 --> 00:59:56,159
Come on.

511
00:59:59,120 --> 01:00:04,679
Where have you been? You keep disappearing.

512
01:00:10,120 --> 01:00:13,159
Let's get started.

513
01:00:28,640 --> 01:00:33,159
Well, Gunduz Bey. Welcome again.

514
01:00:35,640 --> 01:00:41,159
We defeated the enemy.
You're free now. Tell me.

515
01:00:41,160 --> 01:00:44,679
-When will your tribe come?
-With Allah's will,

516
01:00:45,120 --> 01:00:48,159
...they'll be here soon, Osman Bey.

517
01:00:48,640 --> 01:00:52,159
Then, it'll be a great day for Kayi.

518
01:00:52,160 --> 01:00:56,159
A dream will come true.
Kayi will get united again.

519
01:00:56,160 --> 01:01:00,679
I hope so, I hope so.
We're getting united now.

520
01:01:02,120 --> 01:01:05,159
We're becoming a huge family.

521
01:01:05,640 --> 01:01:10,679
Then, reveal your secrets.

522
01:01:14,120 --> 01:01:19,679
Tell me about what you are hiding.

523
01:01:35,120 --> 01:01:39,679
Osman Bey, you never fail to see.

524
01:01:42,640 --> 01:01:45,679
That’s what I was going to talk about.

525
01:01:45,680 --> 01:01:52,679
Tajeddin Noyan is dead. So we
don’t have to keep this secret anymore.

526
01:01:59,120 --> 01:02:03,159
Ayca Hatun..

527
01:02:05,120 --> 01:02:09,679
...is my daughter-in-law who my
martyr son trusted me to look after.

528
01:02:15,680 --> 01:02:19,679
Efendize Elcim is my daughter.

529
01:02:30,640 --> 01:02:34,159
Why did you do such a thing, Gunduz Bey?

530
01:02:34,160 --> 01:02:40,159
Olcaytu Khan used to make daughters
of Beys marry his commanders...

531
01:02:40,160 --> 01:02:44,679
...to keep beylics in order and make them obey.

532
01:02:49,120 --> 01:02:53,159
When they raided our tribe to take Elcim,

533
01:02:53,160 --> 01:02:57,159
...my daughter-in-law Ayca played such a game.

534
01:03:12,160 --> 01:03:15,159
GERMIYANOGLU BORDER - FRONTIER MARKET

535
01:03:17,120 --> 01:03:22,679
What do you mean you can't find
her, Kanyumaz? Where is Gonca?

536
01:03:22,680 --> 01:03:27,679
She's gone, Mehmed Bey. We
looked everywhere but couldn't find her.

537
01:03:28,640 --> 01:03:36,159
Gonca... Gonca... Keep looking
then. There must be a trail;

538
01:03:37,640 --> 01:03:42,679
Gonca... If anything happens to Gonca,

539
01:03:42,680 --> 01:03:49,679
...will burn the frontiers! I
will burn the frontiers in flames!

540
01:03:51,120 --> 01:03:55,159
Aren't we supposed to let
Yakup Bey know, Mehmed Bey?

541
01:04:01,120 --> 01:04:05,159
Yes, we are.

542
01:04:05,640 --> 01:04:07,679
Shall we also tell him...

543
01:04:07,680 --> 01:04:11,679
...how Osman Bey became a hero in our market?

544
01:04:12,120 --> 01:04:19,159
Never. My father will never know,
find Cerkutay. Now go sister, my

545
01:04:20,120 --> 01:04:23,679
Whatever you order.

546
01:04:25,640 --> 01:04:28,159
I'll first find my sister.

547
01:04:28,640 --> 01:04:33,679
Then I'll show everyone who
Germiyanoglu Mehmed Bey is.

548
01:04:34,120 --> 01:04:37,159
-Kanyumaz.
-My Bey.

549
01:04:37,640 --> 01:04:41,679
Tell alps to put the merchants in order.

550
01:04:42,640 --> 01:04:45,679
Crying out for Osman Bey in my market?

551
01:04:45,680 --> 01:04:50,159
-They’ll all know there is a price for that.
-As you order, my Bey.

552
01:04:53,640 --> 01:04:56,159
Gonca..

553
01:05:00,120 --> 01:05:06,159
Mehmed Bey, Imren Tegin is here.
He wants to see you on behalf of Byzantine.

554
01:05:06,640 --> 01:05:12,679
Imren Tegin? What would he do here?

555
01:05:14,120 --> 01:05:17,159
Let him in.

556
01:05:34,120 --> 01:05:38,159
Germiyanoglu Mehmed Bey.

557
01:05:40,120 --> 01:05:45,159
I wanted to see you on your chair in your tent.

558
01:05:55,120 --> 01:06:00,679
While you were Byzantine's nightmare,
why did the emperor send you here?

559
01:06:04,120 --> 01:06:10,159
You're asking what such a great
man would do in your tent. Right.

560
01:06:12,120 --> 01:06:16,159
What do you want?
-Trade.

561
01:06:17,640 --> 01:06:21,159
I want to trade with you.

562
01:06:21,640 --> 01:06:24,679
Germiyanoglu Mehmed Bey.

563
01:06:24,680 --> 01:06:29,679
What made you think that I'd
accept this offer, Imren Tegin?

564
01:06:30,120 --> 01:06:34,159
Because I can see your desire for
power which is eating your brains out.

565
01:06:36,120 --> 01:06:40,159
I saw you in Tajeddin Noyan's headquarters.

566
01:06:40,640 --> 01:06:45,679
I know on which side you are and
who you are holding a grudge against.

567
01:06:46,120 --> 01:06:49,679
And you will know about me.

568
01:06:50,640 --> 01:06:55,679
Our arrows are pointed towards
the same target. If you work with me,

569
01:06:56,120 --> 01:06:59,679
...you will always hit the target.

570
01:06:59,680 --> 01:07:04,159
And you will have the power you are dreaming of.

571
01:07:09,120 --> 01:07:12,159
Consider.

572
01:07:21,640 --> 01:07:25,159
Well, that's it. Thanks to Ayca,

573
01:07:25,160 --> 01:07:28,679
I didn't give my daughter to Mongolians.

574
01:07:30,800 --> 01:07:34,479
But you could have told us
about it when you came here.

575
01:07:34,720 --> 01:07:37,759
Why did you keep this secret for so long?

576
01:07:37,760 --> 01:07:42,759
You're right, Bala Hatun. We
haven't got rid of the trouble yet.

577
01:07:42,760 --> 01:07:48,799
Tajeddin Noyan may be dead
but Olcaytu still has the throne.

578
01:07:49,120 --> 01:07:53,679
He will knock on my door sooner or later.

579
01:07:54,240 --> 01:08:00,279
Don’t worry. They'll be only welcomed
with our swords when they come to our door.

580
01:08:01,240 --> 01:08:06,759
When we are united, nobody can beat us.

581
01:08:08,640 --> 01:08:14,159
We won't let anyone harm our
children. We are united now.

582
01:08:16,640 --> 01:08:20,158
You're right.
That's what I want.

583
01:08:20,640 --> 01:08:23,679
As two Kayi tribes are united now,

584
01:08:23,840 --> 01:08:27,879
...we should crown this unity with a wedding.

585
01:08:49,120 --> 01:08:51,679
Gunduz Bey...

586
01:08:52,720 --> 01:08:56,278
-Speak plainly.
-Osman Bey.

587
01:08:56,640 --> 01:09:01,679
I am a grand Bey with many followers.

588
01:09:02,120 --> 01:09:06,158
Since I am under your protection,
I am under your command.

589
01:09:06,279 --> 01:09:10,839
Since I am under your command, it means
I have to give up on many things.

590
01:09:11,279 --> 01:09:13,839
Fame, reputation..

591
01:09:13,840 --> 01:09:16,839
To not let that happen..

592
01:09:16,840 --> 01:09:21,398
..you know what to do, Osman Bey

593
01:09:22,439 --> 01:09:26,479
Tell me what you mean, Gunduz Bey.

594
01:09:26,960 --> 01:09:29,479
To protect my reputation..

595
01:09:29,479 --> 01:09:33,999
..I want to unite our tribes with a wedding.

596
01:09:45,960 --> 01:09:50,999
For the good of our unity and my daughter..

597
01:09:51,000 --> 01:09:54,999
..I want my daughter Elcim..

598
01:09:57,440 --> 01:10:03,999
..to marry your bigger son, Shahzade Orhan.

599
01:10:12,960 --> 01:10:15,999
What are you saying, father?

600
01:10:23,440 --> 01:10:28,999
The wedding ceremony
is an important matter.

601
01:10:30,960 --> 01:10:34,999
This was very sudden.

602
01:10:39,440 --> 01:10:43,479
Let me speak with my house.

603
01:10:44,440 --> 01:10:48,479
You should speak with yours as well.

604
01:10:48,960 --> 01:10:53,479
Okay, Osman Bey.

605
01:11:10,960 --> 01:11:15,999
Orhan, I risked everything.

606
01:11:16,000 --> 01:11:21,479
Please save me from this
sinister castle I got trapped in.

607
01:11:21,480 --> 01:11:26,479
I can not handle wars and
being without you anymore.

608
01:11:26,960 --> 01:11:30,479
I want to learn Islam to become a muslim as well.

609
01:11:30,960 --> 01:11:33,479
Just give me some time.

610
01:11:33,960 --> 01:11:39,479
The one who loves you the most, your Holofira.

611
01:11:57,960 --> 01:12:01,479
You've heard Gunduz Bey.

612
01:12:01,960 --> 01:12:06,999
What do you say about this? Orhan?

613
01:12:08,160 --> 01:12:13,199
My Bey, you know what goes through my head..

614
01:12:14,440 --> 01:12:18,999
..and through my heart. However, this matter..

615
01:12:19,440 --> 01:12:22,999
..is quite sudden for me, my Bey.

616
01:12:25,960 --> 01:12:28,479
What do you say, Malhun?

617
01:12:29,440 --> 01:12:31,999
Elcim looks like a good girl, my Bey.

618
01:12:32,440 --> 01:12:35,999
She is one of us. From our roots.

619
01:12:36,000 --> 01:12:38,999
It is a bride that everyone would want.

620
01:12:40,240 --> 01:12:42,679
However..

621
01:12:44,440 --> 01:12:46,999
..Orhan makes the last decision.

622
01:12:47,280 --> 01:12:51,319
His mother will support him,
no matter what he decides.

623
01:12:52,280 --> 01:12:57,319
Alright, alright, alright. Look, son.

624
01:12:58,440 --> 01:13:04,479
I know, these are hard decisions.

625
01:13:05,120 --> 01:13:08,679
However, know this..

626
01:13:08,920 --> 01:13:12,439
..this is not a matter of hearts.

627
01:13:12,840 --> 01:13:16,879
This is a state matter.

628
01:13:18,440 --> 01:13:23,999
The unity of two tribes will
benefit everyone of course.

629
01:13:25,600 --> 01:13:32,119
For the future of the state,
this will be good for us.

630
01:13:36,440 --> 01:13:42,479
My son. I can not push you to make that decision.

631
01:13:43,440 --> 01:13:45,999
You will make the right decision.

632
01:13:46,000 --> 01:13:48,999
-Father..
-Look...

633
01:13:49,000 --> 01:13:53,999
...it is easy to dream of the state,
however, carrying this burden..

634
01:13:54,440 --> 01:13:56,999
..is the real matter.

635
01:13:59,080 --> 01:14:02,119
Now, have some time.

636
01:14:02,160 --> 01:14:06,199
-Go and think about it.
-Thank you, my Bey.

637
01:14:16,840 --> 01:14:19,359
Do not worry, my Bey.

638
01:14:19,440 --> 01:14:22,479
My Orhan will make the right decision.

639
01:14:22,480 --> 01:14:26,999
He will. However, think about it sometimes..

640
01:14:27,000 --> 01:14:30,999
It is harder to be a father than to be a bey.

641
01:14:32,040 --> 01:14:36,999
I see that, being a father is harder.

642
01:14:47,440 --> 01:14:50,999
My Shahzade,she is still burning up.

643
01:14:51,000 --> 01:14:53,999
Ice will work, if Allah permits.

644
01:14:54,320 --> 01:14:59,359
Gonca. Gonca, hold on.

645
01:15:00,440 --> 01:15:03,999
Hold on Gonca. Do not let go.

646
01:15:04,200 --> 01:15:07,239
My Shahzade, what if something happens to her?

647
01:15:09,440 --> 01:15:12,479
May Allah protect her, what
if she doesn't make it out?

648
01:15:12,480 --> 01:15:15,999
Then what will we do? Maybe we shouldn't hide her.

649
01:15:16,000 --> 01:15:19,999
No, nothing will happen to her.

650
01:15:20,440 --> 01:15:24,479
Nothing will happen to her. She is strong.

651
01:15:25,440 --> 01:15:30,479
She is very strong.
She will be on her feet.

652
01:15:31,440 --> 01:15:36,479
She is just tired.

653
01:15:37,960 --> 01:15:42,479
However, she will be alright.

654
01:15:44,960 --> 01:15:48,479
Go change the rag.

655
01:15:55,440 --> 01:15:58,479
What did I do to my mother?
She does not allow me in.

656
01:15:58,960 --> 01:16:01,479
She says she is sick. I am scared, Mother Bala.

657
01:16:01,480 --> 01:16:03,999
Do not be, my valiant. Mothers are strong.

658
01:16:04,000 --> 01:16:07,999
Nothing will happen to her. We will make
a soup for her, then she will be alright.

659
01:16:08,440 --> 01:16:11,479
She will be good, right? Mothers are strong.

660
01:16:11,480 --> 01:16:16,999
She is entrusted with me from my
father. I promised taking care of her.

661
01:16:17,440 --> 01:16:20,479
Do not worry, nothing will happen.

662
01:16:26,960 --> 01:16:29,999
My Shahzade, Bala Hatun is coming.

663
01:16:30,000 --> 01:16:33,999
Now we are done fori
Bala Hatun will kill mei

664
01:16:34,440 --> 01:16:36,999
-She will kill me!
-lllgen Hatun!

665
01:16:37,440 --> 01:16:40,479
Stop.

666
01:16:45,960 --> 01:16:48,999
Baysungur, what are you doing here?

667
01:16:49,440 --> 01:16:52,999
Bala Hatun, I... My Shahzade..

668
01:16:53,440 --> 01:16:56,479
..prepared medicine for Ulgen Hatun.

669
01:16:56,480 --> 01:16:59,999
-I gave her that.
-Did Alaeddin check on her?

670
01:17:00,000 --> 01:17:03,479
-What is wrong with her?
-She does not allow me in!

671
01:17:03,480 --> 01:17:06,479
Mother! I can take care of you!

672
01:17:06,960 --> 01:17:12,999
I don't know what is wrong with her.
my Shahzade told me to not let anyone in.

673
01:17:13,440 --> 01:17:16,999
What is it I wonder.

674
01:17:17,960 --> 01:17:21,479
Bala Hatun, heb says it is contagious.

675
01:17:21,480 --> 01:17:24,999
Maybe do not go in.

676
01:17:31,360 --> 01:17:35,879
Baysungur, let me see with my own eyes.

677
01:17:56,960 --> 01:17:59,519
Ulgen?

678
01:18:00,960 --> 01:18:03,479
Are you alright?

679
01:18:03,760 --> 01:18:07,799
-Mother, what happened to you?
-Bala Hatun?

680
01:18:08,080 --> 01:18:11,959
Do not come in, my son. I am very sick.

681
01:18:12,720 --> 01:18:15,759
I am very.. It is contagious.

682
01:18:15,960 --> 01:18:18,479
So Alaeddin checked on you. What did he say?

683
01:18:18,960 --> 01:18:22,999
-What is wrong with you?
-He did, prepare a medicine.

684
01:18:23,000 --> 01:18:25,479
He told me to rest a bit and it will pass.

685
01:18:25,960 --> 01:18:30,479
It is contagious! Don't get near!

686
01:18:31,960 --> 01:18:34,999
You entrusted with me. Of
course I will take care of you.

687
01:18:35,000 --> 01:18:37,479
My son, I am telling you, it is contagious.

688
01:18:37,480 --> 01:18:39,999
How will you take care of me if you get sick?

689
01:18:40,440 --> 01:18:44,999
She is right. Shahzade Alaeddin will heal her.

690
01:18:45,440 --> 01:18:48,999
Now, tonight you can stay
at Shahzade Alaeddin’s room.

691
01:18:49,000 --> 01:18:52,999
The room of Shahzade Alaeddin.

692
01:18:55,440 --> 01:19:00,479
Let me think about it. However,
what will happen to mother?

693
01:19:00,480 --> 01:19:03,999
Shahzade Alaeddin will heal her. Do not worry.

694
01:19:04,000 --> 01:19:07,479
Take good care of my mother.

695
01:19:07,480 --> 01:19:11,479
Do not worry. Baysungur.

696
01:19:11,960 --> 01:19:16,479
Put two baciyan on the door to
report Ulgen's condition to me.

697
01:19:16,480 --> 01:19:18,479
Yeni Cazibe Noktasi As you command, Bala Hatun.

698
01:19:18,480 --> 01:19:18,999
As you command, Bala Hatun.

699
01:19:19,960 --> 01:19:20,999
Ulgen, you want 33 something, say it to the girls.

700
01:19:21,000 --> 01:19:23,999
Ulgen, if you want something, say it to the girls.

701
01:19:24,440 --> 01:19:27,479
Thank you.

702
01:19:42,160 --> 01:19:47,199
Gonca... Gonca. Gonca.

703
01:19:52,160 --> 01:19:55,679
I keep telling lies!

704
01:20:00,640 --> 01:20:04,199
Bala Hatun will burn me!

705
01:20:04,200 --> 01:20:09,199
I also burden you with a great responsibility,
but you must understand me as well.

706
01:20:09,640 --> 01:20:14,199
We cannot tell anyone the truth, Ulgen Hatun.

707
01:20:14,640 --> 01:20:19,199
We must protect Gonca from Mehmet, her brother.

708
01:20:20,640 --> 01:20:25,199
This burden is my duty, my Shahzade.

709
01:20:26,160 --> 01:20:30,199
I owe a lot to you and to her.

710
01:20:32,640 --> 01:20:38,199
It's okay.
It's okay.

711
01:20:41,160 --> 01:20:46,199
Father... don't do this to
me. Do not want this from me.

712
01:20:46,640 --> 01:20:50,679
I am Kayi Bey Gunduz.

713
01:20:51,160 --> 01:20:55,679
Elcim... If I bow down to Osman...

714
01:20:56,160 --> 01:21:00,679
...will lose all my reputation. But...

715
01:21:00,680 --> 01:21:03,679
...if this marriage happens...

716
01:21:03,680 --> 01:21:07,679
...Osman and I will be equal.

717
01:21:08,160 --> 01:21:12,679
Besides, you will be the
daughter-in-law in Osman Bey's family.

718
01:21:12,680 --> 01:21:16,679
-You should be happy...
-Never!

719
01:21:17,160 --> 01:21:20,679
I will not marry that man who loves another Hatun!

720
01:21:21,160 --> 01:21:23,679
-What are you saying?
-Father...

721
01:21:23,680 --> 01:21:28,199
...Orhan Bey loves another Hatun.

722
01:21:29,640 --> 01:21:34,199
You don't have the option to choose, Elcim.

723
01:21:35,640 --> 01:21:39,679
You will marry Orhan Bey,

724
01:21:39,680 --> 01:21:44,199
You will do this for our Beylic.

725
01:21:44,200 --> 01:21:50,679
Don't you worry about my honour, father?
Everyone knows Orhan Bey loves another woman.

726
01:21:50,680 --> 01:21:55,199
-I will not marry a man who does not want me!
-Enough!

727
01:21:55,640 --> 01:22:00,199
Since when have you been
raising your voice to your father?

728
01:22:03,640 --> 01:22:10,199
Look... I lost your
mother and your brother.

729
01:22:12,160 --> 01:22:16,679
I only have you left. You
are the only one I can trust.

730
01:22:16,680 --> 01:22:21,199
And you will do this for us.

731
01:22:21,640 --> 01:22:25,199
This marriage will happen as soon as possible.

732
01:22:25,200 --> 01:22:30,199
Father... If my
mother was alive...

733
01:22:30,200 --> 01:22:33,199
...she would never let this happen.

734
01:22:36,640 --> 01:22:42,679
You are making me feel my motherlessness
with what you deem appropriate, father.

735
01:22:45,640 --> 01:22:50,199
If your mother was here, she would also want this.

736
01:22:54,640 --> 01:22:59,199
You are Efendize Elcim Hatun.

737
01:22:59,640 --> 01:23:04,199
You are from Kayi tribe,
from Hayme mother's lineage.

738
01:23:04,200 --> 01:23:08,199
Now... you will do what suits you...

739
01:23:08,640 --> 01:23:13,679
...and you will marry Hayme
mother's grandson Orhan Bey.

740
01:23:14,160 --> 01:23:22,679
But... Osman Bey will
first ask for your permission.

741
01:23:23,640 --> 01:23:31,199
I know that you are going to
give the best answer for our family.

742
01:23:56,160 --> 01:24:00,199
Holofira...

743
01:24:16,160 --> 01:24:19,679
I broke your heart like this necklace, Holofira.

744
01:24:20,160 --> 01:24:26,199
I couldn’t protect you, I
couldn’t protect my love.

745
01:24:38,640 --> 01:24:41,679
Now if I...

746
01:24:42,160 --> 01:24:45,199
...give up on everything...

747
01:24:45,440 --> 01:24:50,479
...if I give up on Bey Orhan, Shahzade Orhan...

748
01:24:50,480 --> 01:24:55,999
...if I leave everything, free
myself and come to you...

749
01:25:02,640 --> 01:25:05,679
I cannot do that.

750
01:25:19,040 --> 01:25:23,559
I grew up with this dream.

751
01:25:23,640 --> 01:25:28,199
I swore to spill every drop of
my blood for my father’s dreams...

752
01:25:28,200 --> 01:25:32,199
...for the glorification of...

753
01:25:32,640 --> 01:25:36,199
...the word of Allah.

754
01:25:37,640 --> 01:25:41,679
But I wanted to...

755
01:25:42,160 --> 01:25:46,199
...walk this path with you.

756
01:25:46,640 --> 01:25:50,199
I wanted to fulfill my dreams with you.

757
01:25:50,640 --> 01:25:54,199
Now they want to take my dreams from me.

758
01:25:55,640 --> 01:26:02,679
Now they want me to marry Elcim Hatun.

759
01:26:05,640 --> 01:26:09,199
My Allah, show me a way.

760
01:26:09,200 --> 01:26:15,679
What am I going to choose? The state...

761
01:26:16,160 --> 01:26:20,679
..or my beloved one?

762
01:26:21,160 --> 01:26:25,679
Of course, I love her so much...

763
01:26:26,640 --> 01:26:30,199
..but the state...

764
01:26:31,640 --> 01:26:36,199
The state is greater than
our love, Lord's daughter.

765
01:26:36,640 --> 01:26:41,679
For this state, many people...

766
01:26:41,680 --> 01:26:47,199
...gave up on their lives, their
mothers and their children.

767
01:26:48,160 --> 01:26:55,679
Now I am being tested with my love for you.

768
01:26:57,640 --> 01:27:00,679
For the state...

769
01:27:01,160 --> 01:27:05,679
...let the love of Osman's
son Orhan be sacrificed too.

770
01:27:06,160 --> 01:27:11,199
May the state exist.

771
01:27:29,160 --> 01:27:34,679
-Konur tell me. Did Karasid Bey host you well?
-He did, my Bey.

772
01:27:35,160 --> 01:27:39,199
When people heard that Tajeddin
was beheaded, they started celebrating.

773
01:27:39,640 --> 01:27:42,679
Karasid Bey was pleased and overjoyed.

774
01:27:42,680 --> 01:27:47,199
It's not enough to rejoice together,
will he be with us in the battlefield?

775
01:27:47,640 --> 01:27:52,199
Will he stand behind us when
Olcaytu's army comes? This is important.

776
01:27:52,200 --> 01:27:54,679
He will, my Bey. Not only him...

777
01:27:55,160 --> 01:27:57,679
...I visited all the tribes around.

778
01:27:57,680 --> 01:28:00,679
They are saying that they
will stand behind Osman Bey.

779
01:28:01,160 --> 01:28:04,679
Thank you, thank you.
Thank to them.

780
01:28:05,640 --> 01:28:09,199
-There is another issue.
-What is it?

781
01:28:09,640 --> 01:28:12,679
Too many crusaders ar
coming to the Karasid harbour.

782
01:28:12,680 --> 01:28:16,199
And we don’t know who they
are or where they are coming from.

783
01:28:16,200 --> 01:28:20,199
What happened, Konur Bey? Is
ancient Rome being resurrected?

784
01:28:21,640 --> 01:28:25,199
Do they have swords?

785
01:28:25,640 --> 01:28:31,199
There are no Hatuns and children among
them right? They are coming for a war.

786
01:28:31,640 --> 01:28:35,679
My Bey... Who are they coming for? The Emperor?

787
01:28:35,680 --> 01:28:38,199
No.

788
01:28:39,160 --> 01:28:42,679
For the Executioner of Roman Empire.

789
01:28:44,640 --> 01:28:47,679
We will not let anyone hear this for now.

790
01:28:47,680 --> 01:28:52,199
Orhan. Konur. Get ready.

791
01:28:52,640 --> 01:28:56,199
Go to the harbour. You
need to get news from there.

792
01:28:56,200 --> 01:28:58,679
-Yes my Bey.
-Yes my Bey.

793
01:28:58,680 --> 01:29:01,199
My son.

794
01:29:03,160 --> 01:29:07,679
You are just going there to get
news. Don't do anything heroic.

795
01:29:07,680 --> 01:29:11,199
-Okay my Bey.
-Go now.

796
01:29:13,640 --> 01:29:17,679
-Can I come in, my Bey?
-Come in.

797
01:29:19,640 --> 01:29:23,679
My Bey. We found Noyan's helper Abdulkasim.

798
01:29:23,680 --> 01:29:25,199
He is hiding with ten nokers.

799
01:29:25,200 --> 01:29:29,199
We have a lot of things to learn from that dog.

800
01:29:29,640 --> 01:29:34,199
The executioner of Roman Empire is getting ready.

801
01:29:34,200 --> 01:29:37,199
Apparently, he will hurt us badly.

802
01:29:37,640 --> 01:29:42,679
But first, we will go and
get rid of this Mongol issue.

803
01:29:42,680 --> 01:29:48,679
-Inform Gunduz BeyWe will set out.
-Yes my Bey.

804
01:30:07,160 --> 01:30:10,679
Bayindir Bey. How do Turks say?

805
01:30:10,680 --> 01:30:14,679
-You brought joy.
-Thank you, Olivia Hatun.

806
01:30:15,160 --> 01:30:20,199
-Aren't Lords here?
-Not yet. They will all come soon.

807
01:30:20,200 --> 01:30:23,199
They are curious about
the reason of this invitation.

808
01:30:23,640 --> 01:30:29,679
I am also curious. What does
Osman Bey want besides taxes?

809
01:30:29,680 --> 01:30:34,199
When Lords come, you will learn with them.

810
01:30:43,160 --> 01:30:48,679
My Osman... Are you thinking about Orhan?

811
01:30:56,160 --> 01:30:59,679
Tell me Bala.

812
01:31:01,160 --> 01:31:04,679
What do you think about this marriage?

813
01:31:05,640 --> 01:31:09,199
If this marriage happens, there will be unity.

814
01:31:09,200 --> 01:31:12,679
It will be good for all of us.

815
01:31:12,680 --> 01:31:15,199
But...

816
01:31:15,640 --> 01:31:18,679
...Orhan’s heart will be shattered, my Osman.

817
01:31:19,160 --> 01:31:22,199
I know... I know.

818
01:31:23,640 --> 01:31:28,679
Can I come in, my Bey?
-Come in, my son.

819
01:31:42,160 --> 01:31:46,199
I have things to tell you, father.

820
01:31:46,640 --> 01:31:50,199
Mother...

821
01:31:52,640 --> 01:31:55,679
Mother, you will get mad, but...

822
01:31:59,640 --> 01:32:02,679
I want you to
listen to me first.

823
01:32:02,680 --> 01:32:05,679
What happened?

824
01:32:07,160 --> 01:32:10,679
-What happened, my son? Tell me.
-Is this issue...

825
01:32:11,160 --> 01:32:15,199
...about Gonca? I heard she was lost.

826
01:32:20,160 --> 01:32:23,199
Gonca is not lost.

827
01:32:28,160 --> 01:32:32,199
She is here, in the palace.

828
01:32:32,200 --> 01:32:35,199
What are you talking about?

829
01:32:35,200 --> 01:32:38,679
AlaeddinI What is Gonca doing here?

830
01:32:40,640 --> 01:32:43,679
Gonca Hatun...

831
01:32:45,160 --> 01:32:49,679
...yesterday, Gonca Hatun
came to Yenisehir to tell us that...

832
01:32:50,160 --> 01:32:55,199
...Tajeddin came to the marketplace.
-And?

833
01:32:57,160 --> 01:33:02,679
When the assassin woman attacked
me, she threw herself in front of me.

834
01:33:09,160 --> 01:33:12,679
She got injured.

835
01:33:19,640 --> 01:33:24,679
My son... Do you hear what you are saying?

836
01:33:28,160 --> 01:33:32,679
Germiyanoglu Yakup Bey's daughter...

837
01:33:33,160 --> 01:33:38,199
You are saying that she is
here! She is in the palace!

838
01:33:40,640 --> 01:33:45,679
Alaeddin... Alaeddin!

839
01:33:46,160 --> 01:33:49,199
Do you know what it means
for her to be here injured?

840
01:33:49,200 --> 01:33:53,199
Look into my eyes!
Look into my eyes!

841
01:33:56,640 --> 01:34:00,199
I know... I know, my Bey.

842
01:34:00,200 --> 01:34:03,679
But, I had no other choice, father.

843
01:34:04,640 --> 01:34:11,199
Mehmet... told Gonca that he
would kill her if she talked to me.

844
01:34:15,160 --> 01:34:19,679
I couldn’t have said anything
to anyone before I healed her.

845
01:34:19,680 --> 01:34:23,199
Is she alright?
Where is she now?

846
01:34:25,160 --> 01:34:29,679
She was badly injured. But she is alright for now.

847
01:34:30,160 --> 01:34:33,199
She is in Ulgen Hatun's room.

848
01:34:36,640 --> 01:34:40,679
Alaeddin Ali... My son...

849
01:34:41,160 --> 01:34:46,679
...I don't want any secrets in
my palace again, know that.

850
01:34:47,160 --> 01:34:49,679
Know that.

851
01:34:53,640 --> 01:34:59,199
Now go to Mehmet and tell him. Where is Gonca?

852
01:35:13,160 --> 01:35:19,679
My Orhan...
-I was wondering when my mother would come.

853
01:35:19,680 --> 01:35:24,199
I wanted to talk to my son
and have a conversation.

854
01:35:25,640 --> 01:35:31,199
When did you grow up and fight
for our da'wah like a mountain, huh?

855
01:35:32,640 --> 01:35:38,199
Mother... I know what is hiding under your tongue.

856
01:35:39,640 --> 01:35:43,199
You will talk about the marriage issue.

857
01:35:44,160 --> 01:35:48,199
My day, my sun... My brave son.

858
01:35:49,160 --> 01:35:52,199
I know what your he.art wants.

859
01:35:52,200 --> 01:35:55,199
But you are Osman Bey's son.

860
01:35:55,640 --> 01:35:59,679
It is your biggest duty to show
consent to what falls to your share...

861
01:35:59,680 --> 01:36:02,199
...from this dream of a state.

862
01:36:02,200 --> 01:36:07,199
Is it also my duty to have my heart...

863
01:36:10,160 --> 01:36:13,199
...crushed between two stones, mother?

864
01:36:16,640 --> 01:36:19,679
Come... Come here, my son.

865
01:36:27,640 --> 01:36:32,199
My son... You saw Elcim Hatun.

866
01:36:32,200 --> 01:36:35,679
She is very beautiful, smart and wise.

867
01:36:36,160 --> 01:36:39,679
Their lineage suits us, their morals suit us.

868
01:36:39,680 --> 01:36:44,679
She is a Hatun who can enlighten your burden
and stand next to you like a mountain.

869
01:36:44,680 --> 01:36:49,679
Ya... Right, mother?

870
01:36:51,640 --> 01:36:55,679
The Turkmen daughter-in-law you always wanted.

871
01:36:57,160 --> 01:37:02,199
Ah, my Orhan, ah... What matters
is not what your mother wants...

872
01:37:02,640 --> 01:37:06,679
...but the future of our da'wah.

873
01:37:06,680 --> 01:37:10,679
I want what I want for this reason.

874
01:37:10,680 --> 01:37:14,679
Then tell me, mother.

875
01:37:15,160 --> 01:37:20,199
How am I going to accept this when I love...

876
01:37:20,640 --> 01:37:24,679
..Holofira, huh?

877
01:37:25,640 --> 01:37:29,679
How am I going to call anyone else
"my Hatun" besides Holofira, mother?

878
01:37:30,160 --> 01:37:35,199
In our hearts, there is no love greater
than the dream of a state, my son.

879
01:37:35,200 --> 01:37:38,679
There cannot be. Look at us.

880
01:37:38,680 --> 01:37:41,199
Look at me, your father, your Bala mother.

881
01:37:42,440 --> 01:37:44,959
None of us has went through easy challenges.

882
01:37:44,960 --> 01:37:48,479
However, we were a tribe and became a house.

883
01:37:48,480 --> 01:37:51,479
We were a house and became a palace.

884
01:37:51,480 --> 01:37:55,959
To conquer the Wor-ld, we will be challenged.

885
01:37:56,040 --> 01:37:59,079
You will be challenged as well.

886
01:37:59,920 --> 01:38:02,959
Challenges you say..

887
01:38:09,440 --> 01:38:13,479
This is a great challenge, mother.

888
01:38:13,480 --> 01:38:15,959
Besides me..

889
01:38:16,440 --> 01:38:19,959
..with Allah’s permission. I can handle it.

890
01:38:21,920 --> 01:38:24,959
However, Holofira..

891
01:38:25,920 --> 01:38:28,959
How will I come up to her..

892
01:38:29,440 --> 01:38:32,479
..and make her . live with this pain?

893
01:38:34,440 --> 01:38:37,479
The matter of a state dream...

894
01:38:37,480 --> 01:38:39,959
..with two tribes on one hand..

895
01:38:40,440 --> 01:38:44,959
..Holofira and you on the other.

896
01:38:50,440 --> 01:38:55,479
Of course, the last one to decide is Orhan Bey.

897
01:38:55,920 --> 01:39:01,479
However, I know that my
Orhan will make the right decision.

898
01:39:14,440 --> 01:39:19,479
A beautiful on one hand..

899
01:39:20,440 --> 01:39:23,959
..and a state that is above all on the other.

900
01:39:28,440 --> 01:39:31,479
You made us really scared, Gonca.

901
01:39:31,480 --> 01:39:33,959
And Shahzade Alaeddin..

902
01:39:33,960 --> 01:39:37,479
..he was very afraid that
something would happen to you.

903
01:39:37,480 --> 01:39:39,959
It is just remorse, lllgen.

904
01:39:39,960 --> 01:39:42,959
I heard what I heard from him.

905
01:39:42,960 --> 01:39:47,479
-It is enough for me.
-He loves you a lot, Gonca.

906
01:39:48,440 --> 01:39:51,479
He still loves you very much.

907
01:39:52,440 --> 01:39:54,959
This is all because of me.

908
01:39:55,440 --> 01:39:57,959
However, forgive me. I had to, my Gonca.

909
01:39:58,440 --> 01:40:02,959
No, you are not to blame.

910
01:40:06,440 --> 01:40:09,479
Hatuns, Osman Bey is coming.

911
01:40:22,920 --> 01:40:28,479
My daughter. Get well soon, a lot happened to you.

912
01:40:28,920 --> 01:40:31,959
-We've heard.
-I am alright, thank you Osman Bey.

913
01:40:32,440 --> 01:40:37,959
You saved my son’s life. Thank you, Gonca Hatun.

914
01:40:43,920 --> 01:40:46,959
I could not apologize to you properly.

915
01:40:48,720 --> 01:40:53,759
I am sorry, in the name of my
family and what happened before.

916
01:40:56,240 --> 01:40:59,759
It is not right for me to
come to Yenisehir, I know.

917
01:40:59,760 --> 01:41:03,279
However, I was afraid that my
brother would make a mistake.

918
01:41:06,240 --> 01:41:09,279
You did alright, my daughter.

919
01:41:09,720 --> 01:41:14,279
We spoke with your brother as
well. May he prosper if Allah permits.

920
01:41:22,240 --> 01:41:27,279
We owe you a life. The doors
of Yenisehir are open to you.

921
01:41:27,280 --> 01:41:31,759
You are always welcomed here.

922
01:41:35,720 --> 01:41:43,279
Thank you, Osman Bey. I did
nothing compared to what you did.

923
01:41:45,720 --> 01:41:48,759
Take care of yourself.

924
01:42:23,760 --> 01:42:28,759
Your aunt allowed you to take a
breath. However, we can’t stay for long.

925
01:42:29,720 --> 01:42:33,319
-Isn't he Orhan's alp?
-Yes.

926
01:42:33,319 --> 01:42:37,279
Bayindir Beylis inside.
He must've come with him.

927
01:42:54,720 --> 01:42:57,279
That is Imren.

928
01:43:14,240 --> 01:43:19,759
Did Osman Bey made Byzantine
and lords bow down with you?

929
01:43:19,760 --> 01:43:23,759
Yes. You are lucky.

930
01:43:23,760 --> 01:43:28,279
I saw you in peace, not in battle.

931
01:43:29,240 --> 01:43:32,759
Peace is over, don't you know?

932
01:43:32,760 --> 01:43:37,759
It won't start again, until
the very last Kayi dies.

933
01:43:48,720 --> 01:43:52,759
What are you saying? Who are you?

934
01:44:13,720 --> 01:44:17,279
I'm Executioner of Rome, Imren Tegin.

935
01:44:51,720 --> 01:44:56,759
I can't stand this anymore. My
aunt completely lost her mind.

936
01:44:58,240 --> 01:45:00,759
Please help me.

937
01:45:00,760 --> 01:45:03,759
Help me get out of this castle.

938
01:45:05,240 --> 01:45:10,759
Or take my letter to Orhan. Please.

939
01:45:40,720 --> 01:45:43,759
Orhan Bey.

940
01:45:55,240 --> 01:46:00,279
I didn't know about this wedding thing before.

941
01:46:00,720 --> 01:46:05,279
Then you wouldn't want a marriage
with someone you don't know at all, huh?

942
01:46:07,240 --> 01:46:09,759
When it's about the future of two beylics,

943
01:46:09,760 --> 01:46:13,759
....what I want doesn’t matter at all, Orhan Bey.

944
01:46:16,240 --> 01:46:19,759
Then you will accept.

945
01:46:20,240 --> 01:46:24,279
I will do whatever my duty requires. You?

946
01:46:25,240 --> 01:46:29,759
Will you accept if Osman Bey says yes?

947
01:46:32,720 --> 01:46:36,759
While you have someone else in your heart?

948
01:46:45,240 --> 01:46:47,759
Holofira.

949
01:47:01,720 --> 01:47:05,759
-Brother.
-Brother.

950
01:47:07,720 --> 01:47:10,759
Did you make up your mind?

951
01:47:11,240 --> 01:47:14,759
About the marriage?

952
01:47:15,720 --> 01:47:20,279
I am in such a fire, Alaaddin...

953
01:47:20,280 --> 01:47:23,759
...that I’m stuck in it.

954
01:47:25,720 --> 01:47:28,279
Brother.

955
01:47:31,720 --> 01:47:35,279
Osman Bey's sons win all the fights...

956
01:47:35,280 --> 01:47:38,279
...but lose the battle of love, huh?

957
01:47:38,720 --> 01:47:40,759
Will we always lose, brother?

958
01:47:40,760 --> 01:47:44,759
Yes. Yes.

959
01:47:45,240 --> 01:47:48,279
We’re both wounded in the same spot.

960
01:47:48,720 --> 01:47:52,279
But mine is obvious at least.

961
01:47:53,240 --> 01:47:59,279
You're hiding, Alaaddin.
What did you do about Gonca?

962
01:48:00,240 --> 01:48:04,759
-Brother.
-My Shahzade.

963
01:48:08,240 --> 01:48:12,759
We’ll talk later, brother. Later.

964
01:48:13,720 --> 01:48:16,759
Everything is set. We can go.

965
01:48:17,240 --> 01:48:20,759
-Let's go.
-Have a safe journey, brother.

966
01:48:20,760 --> 01:48:23,759
Thank you. Thank you.

967
01:48:24,720 --> 01:48:27,759
Konur Bey.

968
01:48:56,720 --> 01:49:00,279
-My lady.
Just say it, Andra.

969
01:49:00,720 --> 01:49:03,279
Holofira wrote a letter and...

970
01:49:03,280 --> 01:49:05,759
...wanted me to
take it to Orhan Bey.

971
01:49:05,760 --> 01:49:09,279
I didn't want to do anything without asking you.

972
01:49:10,720 --> 01:49:14,279
Won't you give up, Holofira?

973
01:49:19,720 --> 01:49:24,279
-No letters!
-Stop.

974
01:49:29,240 --> 01:49:30,439
Out!

975
01:49:33,720 --> 01:49:36,279
You aren't smart, Olivia.

976
01:49:36,280 --> 01:49:39,759
You're destroying a great chance.

977
01:49:40,240 --> 01:49:43,279
What is in your mind?

978
01:49:43,720 --> 01:49:47,759
What I started with Alaaddin
will be finished with Orhan.

979
01:49:49,720 --> 01:49:54,279
Osman is going to lose one of his sons this time.

980
01:50:07,720 --> 01:50:12,279
Osman Bey, there is the dog.

981
01:50:14,720 --> 01:50:18,279
Gunduz Bey, the dog will survive.

982
01:50:18,280 --> 01:50:22,759
Do whatever you want with the rest. I need him.

983
01:50:28,720 --> 01:50:33,759
I can't forget what he did to my tribe, Osman Bey.

984
01:50:35,240 --> 01:50:37,759
You make him speak.

985
01:50:37,760 --> 01:50:41,759
-But he will be mine in the end.
-It's time. Let's go.

986
01:50:48,240 --> 01:50:53,279
-Alps, attack;
-We're under attack;

987
01:51:51,720 --> 01:51:55,759
My Bey, he's running off;

988
01:52:01,720 --> 01:52:06,279
Where are you going before
you tell me what you know?

989
01:52:13,240 --> 01:52:16,759
Thank you, warriors. Thank you.

990
01:52:17,240 --> 01:52:19,759
Long live. Thank you.

991
01:52:21,720 --> 01:52:24,279
Speak now.

992
01:52:25,720 --> 01:52:30,759
Speak now. Speak!

993
01:53:03,880 --> 01:53:07,439
The Emperor must've
thought about his own interests.

994
01:53:07,880 --> 01:53:13,439
-I want peace.
-You are saying peace, huh, Hatun?

995
01:53:13,440 --> 01:53:17,919
You are saying peace. We do not hurt you...

996
01:53:17,920 --> 01:53:22,439
...because you are Holofira's aunt.

997
01:53:22,440 --> 01:53:26,919
Or, do you think we're unaware of you...

998
01:53:27,400 --> 01:53:32,439
...uniting with the Kite Lord to play games?

999
01:53:35,880 --> 01:53:40,919
-The past is in the past.
-You are right, you are right.

1000
01:53:41,880 --> 01:53:45,439
That's why you will prepare
the taxes as soon as possible.

1001
01:53:45,880 --> 01:53:49,919
We have no time to wait.

1002
01:54:14,880 --> 01:54:19,439
You must be Bayindir.

1003
01:54:24,400 --> 01:54:29,919
Yes. Kayi's Bayindir.

1004
01:54:33,880 --> 01:54:36,919
Who are you?

1005
01:54:37,880 --> 01:54:41,919
The owner of all the castles in these lands.

1006
01:54:45,880 --> 01:54:49,439
Olivia I Where are the Lords?

1007
01:54:49,880 --> 01:54:55,919
Talk to me, Bayindir.
Ask your questions to me.

1008
01:54:55,920 --> 01:54:59,919
I killed all those traitors
with my hands one by one.

1009
01:55:02,880 --> 01:55:05,919
-Are you...
-I am.

1010
01:55:05,920 --> 01:55:10,439
Executioner of Roman Empire, Imren Tegin.

1011
01:55:13,880 --> 01:55:17,439
I will send your dead body
to Osman instead of taxes.

1012
01:55:17,440 --> 01:55:21,439
Good then.

1013
01:55:23,400 --> 01:55:28,439
I would be pleased. At least, I will be...

1014
01:55:28,880 --> 01:55:32,439
..buried in my own lands.

1015
01:55:45,880 --> 01:55:49,439
With what sword can you...

1016
01:55:49,440 --> 01:55:52,919
...threaten someone whose reunion is shahada...

1017
01:55:52,920 --> 01:55:55,439
..infidel?

1018
01:56:00,880 --> 01:56:06,439
Your men were not this brave.
They screamed a lot as they died.

1019
01:56:09,400 --> 01:56:15,919
You... Did you... kill my valiants?

1020
01:56:16,400 --> 01:56:21,439
Infidel!

1021
01:57:24,040 --> 01:57:27,439
Osman must have been relieved
after getting rid of Tajeddin Noyan.

1022
01:57:28,080 --> 01:57:35,119
But when he learns that I am the actual
trouble for him, he will be out of breath.

1023
01:57:45,800 --> 01:57:50,319
But you will not be able to see this.

1024
01:57:50,720 --> 01:57:53,239
I will put you in the coffin alive.

1025
01:57:57,440 --> 01:57:58,919
Don’t...

1026
01:58:00,400 --> 01:58:05,959
Don't you die right away. I don't want
you to die until you are taken to Osman.

1027
01:58:10,560 --> 01:58:13,599
What are you going to do now?

1028
01:58:13,600 --> 01:58:18,639
I will go to Yenisehir and give Osman his taxes.

1029
01:58:21,920 --> 01:58:25,479
So that you are not telling
me, Boran, skin him out!

1030
01:58:25,480 --> 01:58:29,319
Stop! Stop! Stop Tajeddin Noyan..

1031
01:58:29,320 --> 01:58:33,319
...brought hundreds of weapons from Tabriz.

1032
01:58:34,600 --> 01:58:38,639
They were all buried in Kurtmese.

1033
01:58:39,040 --> 01:58:42,599
Let me go!
-Are you bargaining now, dog?

1034
01:58:42,600 --> 01:58:45,119
That’s all I know.

1035
01:58:45,120 --> 01:58:48,639
The things you just said are not
enough to keep you alive. Tell me more.

1036
01:58:48,880 --> 01:58:51,399
Tell me.

1037
01:58:51,680 --> 01:58:55,239
-Boran!
-Stop! Stop! I will talk;

1038
01:58:55,880 --> 01:58:58,439
I will talk! Alright!

1039
01:58:58,520 --> 01:59:01,039
There is a big secret!

1040
01:59:01,280 --> 01:59:05,799
Look at me... Look at
me... If this secret is big..

1041
01:59:06,040 --> 01:59:09,599
..then I will spare your life.

1042
01:59:09,680 --> 01:59:12,719
Osman Bey... What are you doing?

1043
01:59:12,720 --> 01:59:15,719
Gunduz Bey. Wait.

1044
01:59:16,400 --> 01:59:19,919
Come on! -Tajeddin Noyan..

1045
01:59:20,400 --> 01:59:23,439
...was meeting with someone for the past few days.

1046
01:59:23,440 --> 01:59:28,479
His name is... Turcopole. Turcopole Imren Tegin.

1047
01:59:28,880 --> 01:59:32,919
Everyone calls him "the
Executioner of Roman Empire".

1048
01:59:33,280 --> 01:59:36,319
Look at me.

1049
01:59:36,760 --> 01:59:39,799
Did that Turcopole come here? Huh?

1050
01:59:40,160 --> 01:59:43,439
He is here. He killed all the
Lords with his own hands.

1051
01:59:43,440 --> 01:59:47,439
And now... he is in Atranos castle.

1052
02:00:06,880 --> 02:00:10,919
My Bey... What are we going to do to this dog?

1053
02:00:12,400 --> 02:00:16,439
Let him go! Ayaz, Yagiz, take him!

1054
02:00:23,880 --> 02:00:28,919
-Send Alps after this dog.
-Okay my Bey.

1055
02:00:29,880 --> 02:00:33,919
Bayindir Bey.. Come on. We are going to Yenisehir.

1056
02:00:34,200 --> 02:00:37,719
We must prepare the army quickly.

1057
02:00:49,880 --> 02:00:53,919
Allah knows that there is
only one love in my heart.

1058
02:00:54,160 --> 02:00:58,199
Being a martyr.
And if you allow me...

1059
02:00:58,400 --> 02:01:01,199
...I am asking for your prayers for this.

1060
02:01:01,200 --> 02:01:05,719
I remembered Abdullah ibn Jahsh's prayer.

1061
02:01:06,400 --> 02:01:11,919
Before Uhud, he said to Sa'd ibn Abi Waqqas...

1062
02:01:11,920 --> 02:01:14,919
’’You will pray, I will say ’Aameen’...

1063
02:01:15,400 --> 02:01:19,919
...I will pray, and you will say ’Aameen’...

1064
02:01:20,080 --> 02:01:27,119
...so our Allah can accept our
prayers." Sa'd ibn Abi Waqqas...

1065
02:01:28,400 --> 02:01:32,439
...prayed to fight all the
infidels, get wounded...

1066
02:01:32,640 --> 02:01:36,199
...and become a martyr.

1067
02:01:36,680 --> 02:01:40,439
Abdullah ibn Jahsh said "Aameen"...

1068
02:01:40,440 --> 02:01:43,919
...and he prayed: 'Send me...

1069
02:01:43,920 --> 02:01:48,439
...strong infidels to fight and...

1070
02:01:48,440 --> 02:01:53,919
...defeat, then let one of
them come and martyr me.

1071
02:01:53,920 --> 02:01:59,439
May they cut off my mouth, nose, and ears.

1072
02:01:59,880 --> 02:02:03,439
When my Allah asks ’where are your limbs?'...

1073
02:02:03,600 --> 02:02:06,119
...will say I committed many sins with them...

1074
02:02:06,400 --> 02:02:10,919
...and I was ashamed to
stand before You with them."

1075
02:02:10,920 --> 02:02:15,439
Sa'd ibn Abi Waqqas unintentionally said...

1076
02:02:15,440 --> 02:02:18,439
.."amen".

1077
02:02:18,880 --> 02:02:24,919
-His prayer was accepted.
-I have many sins as well.

1078
02:02:26,880 --> 02:02:29,919
May Allah..

1079
02:02:30,080 --> 02:02:32,599
...grant me with martyrdom...

1080
02:02:33,360 --> 02:02:35,919
...when He forgives me.

1081
02:02:35,920 --> 02:02:38,919
You're praying like a lover.

1082
02:02:38,920 --> 02:02:41,919
Thank you.

1083
02:02:41,920 --> 02:02:45,439
Lovers don't die, they are eternal...

1084
02:02:45,880 --> 02:02:49,919
...because their souls belong to Allah.

1085
02:03:05,340 --> 02:03:07,919
She's strong.

1086
02:03:08,880 --> 02:03:13,439
Praise be!
It seems GmbH she trained herself well!

1087
02:03:27,880 --> 02:03:31,439
You seem to like that, mother.

1088
02:03:39,880 --> 02:03:43,919
Malhun Hatun. I didn't see you, sorry,

1089
02:03:43,920 --> 02:03:48,919
Don't even mention it, dear.
But you looked angry.

1090
02:03:49,880 --> 02:03:54,439
Are you angry because of the marriage matter?

1091
02:03:58,400 --> 02:04:02,439
If you're here to talk about this...

1092
02:04:05,880 --> 02:04:09,919
No. I wanted to see you, in fact.

1093
02:04:10,760 --> 02:04:15,799
But as far as I see, you
don't want this marriage, huh?

1094
02:04:19,400 --> 02:04:23,919
-You have someone in your heart?
-No.

1095
02:04:24,560 --> 02:04:28,599
I didn't have time to deal
with love affairs, Malhun Hatun.

1096
02:04:29,560 --> 02:04:33,119
Since I left my mother, I’ve
carried my tribe's burden.

1097
02:04:35,080 --> 02:04:38,119
As for the marriage,

1098
02:04:38,560 --> 02:04:43,119
...I've heard that your son
has another woman in his heart.

1099
02:04:44,080 --> 02:04:48,119
I don't want to be the hatun of
a man who loves someone else.

1100
02:04:51,560 --> 02:04:55,119
It means you don't want this marriage, huh?

1101
02:04:55,560 --> 02:04:58,599
If I were only Elcim, no.

1102
02:04:59,080 --> 02:05:02,119
I would never marry your son.

1103
02:05:03,560 --> 02:05:08,599
But I’m Efendize Elcim Hatun, a Bey's daughter.

1104
02:05:09,080 --> 02:05:12,599
I'll do whatever I need to do for my tribe.

1105
02:05:13,080 --> 02:05:15,599
Will I hurt my pride? Yes.

1106
02:05:15,600 --> 02:05:20,119
I will have to accept this marriage
with a bleeding heart, Malhun Hatun.

1107
02:05:37,560 --> 02:05:40,599
I feel so upset when I see you like this.

1108
02:05:41,080 --> 02:05:45,599
Just let me tell Shahzade
Alaaddin that you are innocent.

1109
02:05:46,560 --> 02:05:51,119
No need for that. He didn't
believe my words, Ulgen.

1110
02:06:06,080 --> 02:06:10,599
Gonca Hatun, alps are ready.

1111
02:06:11,080 --> 02:06:14,599
They'll escort you to the frontier market.

1112
02:06:19,560 --> 02:06:22,599
Ulgen can go with you if you like.

1113
02:06:26,080 --> 02:06:30,599
No need. Thanks, Alaaddin Bey.

1114
02:06:44,560 --> 02:06:50,119
Ointment. Apply this on your wounds.

1115
02:06:53,560 --> 02:06:59,599
No need.I can cure my own wound.

1116
02:07:08,080 --> 02:07:12,599
You shouldn't have got one more
wound because of me, Gonca Hatun.

1117
02:07:16,080 --> 02:07:22,599
-Does it hurt much?
-If I had a life, I might feel it.

1118
02:07:25,080 --> 02:07:28,119
Compared to my suffering, this is nothing.

1119
02:07:28,120 --> 02:07:31,599
My heart burns so much..

1120
02:07:34,080 --> 02:07:38,119
...that I feel no other pain but this.

1121
02:07:41,080 --> 02:07:43,599
Who?

1122
02:07:44,080 --> 02:07:47,119
Who made that fire?

1123
02:07:48,080 --> 02:07:51,599
-Is it my fault?
-No.

1124
02:07:52,080 --> 02:07:55,599
I don't blame you.

1125
02:07:57,080 --> 02:08:00,119
It was my mistake.

1126
02:08:00,560 --> 02:08:04,119
I just overestimated this love, Alaaddin.

1127
02:08:09,080 --> 02:08:11,599
I don’t know.

1128
02:08:11,600 --> 02:08:16,599
’’Scholar will understand and believe me.”

1129
02:08:16,600 --> 02:08:20,119
"He’ll see my
suffering", I thought.

1130
02:08:22,080 --> 02:08:25,599
"He won't leave me alone", I thought.

1131
02:08:27,120 --> 02:08:31,159
I never left you alone.

1132
02:08:35,680 --> 02:08:41,239
You know nothing, Alaaddin. Nothing at all.

1133
02:08:43,080 --> 02:08:46,599
You know nothing about my sufferings.

1134
02:08:49,560 --> 02:08:52,599
Do you know why I stayed away from you?

1135
02:08:59,080 --> 02:09:02,119
You don't.

1136
02:09:03,080 --> 02:09:06,599
Because it was easy for you to blame me, right?

1137
02:09:06,600 --> 02:09:09,599
Gonca, don't..

1138
02:09:11,560 --> 02:09:15,119
You left me alone, Alaaddin.

1139
02:09:18,080 --> 02:09:21,119
Just over there, you said it’s over.

1140
02:09:22,080 --> 02:09:25,599
You said you silenced your heart.

1141
02:09:27,080 --> 02:09:30,599
You even couldn’t say my name, remember?

1142
02:09:34,560 --> 02:09:40,119
That day, I killed Trickster Hatun.

1143
02:09:41,080 --> 02:09:43,599
What are you saying?

1144
02:09:48,560 --> 02:09:51,119
It's not over...

1145
02:09:54,560 --> 02:09:57,599
It’s over, Alaaddin Bey.

1146
02:09:59,080 --> 02:10:04,599
What is over in your heart
is over in my heart too.

1147
02:10:06,080 --> 02:10:08,599
Gonca.

1148
02:10:08,600 --> 02:10:12,119
Don't do this.

1149
02:10:14,080 --> 02:10:16,599
Aladdin!

1150
02:10:18,240 --> 02:10:23,799
Alaaddin! Come out, Alaaddin!

1151
02:10:24,889 --> 02:10:28,279
Aladdin! Get out Aladdin!

1152
02:10:28,550 --> 02:10:29,550
Gonca...

1153
02:10:31,080 --> 02:10:35,599
You stay back. He must be furious now.

1154
02:10:39,560 --> 02:10:43,119
Come out!

1155
02:10:47,080 --> 02:10:50,119
Come out, Alaaddin!

1156
02:10:51,080 --> 02:10:53,599
Easy, Mehmed! Easy!

1157
02:10:54,080 --> 02:10:56,599
Are you a just trouble for us?

1158
02:10:57,080 --> 02:11:00,119
Will you bring nothing but
troubles? Where is Gonca?

1159
02:11:00,560 --> 02:11:03,599
Alps, stay back; Mehmed, pull yourself together;

1160
02:11:03,600 --> 02:11:06,119
How many more times should my
sister get wounded because of you?

1161
02:11:06,120 --> 02:11:09,119
Brother; Stop.

1162
02:11:09,120 --> 02:11:12,119
-I will kill you, Alaaddin!
-Brother, stop!

1163
02:11:12,120 --> 02:11:14,599
Alps, what are you waiting for? Hold him

1164
02:11:15,080 --> 02:11:18,599
-Pull yourself together!
-I will kill you!

1165
02:11:19,560 --> 02:11:22,119
Get off! Get off!

1166
02:11:22,120 --> 02:11:25,119
Enough! Pull yourself
together, Mehmed Bey!

1167
02:11:26,080 --> 02:11:29,119
Gonca saved Alaaddin’s life.

1168
02:11:29,560 --> 02:11:33,599
And Alaaddin saved you all,
remember? Your father, you and others...

1169
02:11:33,600 --> 02:11:36,119
Pull yourself together.

1170
02:11:36,400 --> 02:11:40,439
I will kill you, Alaaddin.

1171
02:11:41,400 --> 02:11:45,959
-I will kill you!
-Enough; Stop, brother!

1172
02:11:46,400 --> 02:11:52,439
How can you defend himi
Isn't your life worth anything?

1173
02:11:55,400 --> 02:11:58,959
We will talk about it in
marketplace. Now stop it, please.

1174
02:11:59,400 --> 02:12:03,439
I will kill you Alaeddin!

1175
02:12:03,440 --> 02:12:05,959
You won't see each other again!

1176
02:12:05,960 --> 02:12:09,959
Let it be heard! If you see each other again..

1177
02:12:10,400 --> 02:12:13,959
..I swear I will kill you Alaeddin!

1178
02:12:13,960 --> 02:12:19,439
Your power is only enough to
make empty threats, Mehmed!

1179
02:12:20,920 --> 02:12:24,959
Enough; It is over I said!

1180
02:12:25,920 --> 02:12:28,959
Let him go!

1181
02:12:28,960 --> 02:12:32,439
Come on, move!

1182
02:12:32,920 --> 02:12:36,439
Come on, walk!

1183
02:12:36,920 --> 02:12:42,439
Come on!

1184
02:13:45,920 --> 02:13:47,439
-Boran.
-My Bey.

1185
02:13:47,440 --> 02:13:49,959
Prepare the war equipment.

1186
02:13:49,960 --> 02:13:52,439
-We will walk to Adraneia.
-As you command, my Bey.

1187
02:13:52,920 --> 02:13:56,439
Alps! We will siege Adraneia

1188
02:13:56,440 --> 02:14:01,959
Bayindir Bey is at the hands of
Executioner of Rome, we will take him back.

1189
02:14:02,400 --> 02:14:08,959
Osman Bey. What is it, Osman Bey?

1190
02:14:09,400 --> 02:14:15,439
If we do not move fast, bad things will happen.

1191
02:14:20,400 --> 02:14:22,959
My Bey!

1192
02:14:24,920 --> 02:14:27,959
My Bey. Someone came..

1193
02:14:28,400 --> 02:14:30,439
-They want to see you.
-Who is it?

1194
02:14:30,440 --> 02:14:32,959
He says that he is the leader of lords.

1195
02:14:33,400 --> 02:14:38,439
-What is his name?
-He says it is "Turkopol Imren Tegin".

1196
02:14:38,920 --> 02:14:42,439
-What?
-"Turkopol Imren Tegin".

1197
02:14:45,920 --> 02:14:49,439
Imren Tegin you say.

1198
02:14:52,400 --> 02:14:56,439
The Executioner of Rome.

1199
02:14:56,920 --> 02:15:00,439
So he acted faster than us.

1200
02:15:00,920 --> 02:15:03,959
Let him come.

1201
02:15:05,920 --> 02:15:08,959
Open the gates.

1202
02:15:28,400 --> 02:15:33,959
-Osman Bey.
-What do want?

1203
02:15:41,920 --> 02:15:44,439
I got news from the Emperor.

1204
02:15:44,920 --> 02:15:48,439
You killed his daughter, Princess Maria.

1205
02:15:48,920 --> 02:15:52,959
The issues you have with
Mongols do not concern us.

1206
02:15:52,960 --> 02:15:57,439
You will pay the price of Princess' death.

1207
02:16:03,200 --> 02:16:08,669
Look here! Look here!
I will ask you just once.

1208
02:16:10,920 --> 02:16:14,959
Turkopol dog or whatever you are..

1209
02:16:15,400 --> 02:16:16,959
Where is Bayindir?

1210
02:16:16,960 --> 02:16:20,439
You killed The Emperor of Rome's daughter.

1211
02:16:20,920 --> 02:16:25,959
My duty is to have her vengeance.

1212
02:16:27,920 --> 02:16:31,959
What about the vengeance of your house?

1213
02:16:32,920 --> 02:16:36,959
The State of Seljuks has
fallen because of your treachery!

1214
02:16:36,959 --> 02:16:40,959
States rise, states fall.

1215
02:16:41,400 --> 02:16:45,959
I chose to serve myself, not to states.

1216
02:16:46,400 --> 02:16:52,439
If something happens to Bayindir Bey..

1217
02:16:52,920 --> 02:16:58,439
..then you will see what vengeance is.

1218
02:16:58,440 --> 02:17:00,959
I will be your enemy until the end.

1219
02:17:00,959 --> 02:17:04,959
Osman Bey. I am came here to declare you..

1220
02:17:05,400 --> 02:17:10,439
...a war that won't end until one of us dies.

1221
02:17:11,400 --> 02:17:15,959
However, the war has just been declared.

1222
02:17:15,959 --> 02:17:22,439
That is why, I will hand you your
previous taxes and Bayindir Bey.

1223
02:17:38,920 --> 02:17:43,959
Turkopols always keep their promises.

1224
02:18:08,920 --> 02:18:13,439
My Bey, byzantians are bringing the taxes.

1225
02:18:15,400 --> 02:18:17,959
Let them in.

1226
02:19:10,400 --> 02:19:14,439
Bring them down!

1227
02:19:33,400 --> 02:19:36,959
Open it!

1228
02:19:47,400 --> 02:19:49,959
Kara Ali...

1229
02:19:51,400 --> 02:19:54,959
-He is still alive, my Bey.
-Bayindir!

1230
02:19:54,960 --> 02:19:58,439
“Come on, get him up!
-Come on!

1231
02:19:58,920 --> 02:20:03,959
-Hold him!
-I got him!

1232
02:20:09,920 --> 02:20:15,439
Bayindir! Who did this to you, brother.

1233
02:20:15,440 --> 02:20:20,959
Who? Alaeddin, prepare the room!

1234
02:20:22,400 --> 02:20:25,439
Alaeddin, why are you standing around? Come on;!

1235
02:20:25,440 --> 02:20:28,959
-My Bey.
-My Glorious Bey.

1236
02:20:29,400 --> 02:20:31,959
Listen to me.

1237
02:20:32,920 --> 02:20:35,959
I was born as a Cavundur..

1238
02:20:36,400 --> 02:20:38,959
..and depart as a Kayi.

1239
02:20:39,920 --> 02:20:43,959
-There is no departing, Bayindir.
-My Bey..

1240
02:20:44,920 --> 02:20:47,959
There is nothing left to do now.

1241
02:20:50,400 --> 02:20:55,959
This body I tired..

1242
02:20:56,400 --> 02:21:01,959
..will be delivered to Allah
with proud, thanks to you.

1243
02:21:09,920 --> 02:21:14,439
-Bayindir..
-Give me your blessing.

1244
02:21:14,920 --> 02:21:19,439
Of course, of course..

1245
02:21:21,400 --> 02:21:24,959
Of course I give you my blessing.

1246
02:21:24,960 --> 02:21:30,439
I give you, of course..

1247
02:21:31,400 --> 02:21:36,959
I bear witness that there is none
worthy of worship except Allah...

1248
02:21:39,400 --> 02:21:48,439
and I bear witness that Muhammad
(PBUH) is His servant and Messenger.

1249
02:21:53,920 --> 02:21:59,439
"Indeed, to Allah we belong
and to Allah we shall return."

1250
02:22:11,920 --> 02:22:19,959
Do not worry.

1251
02:22:20,920 --> 02:22:24,439
I swear to you..

1252
02:22:24,440 --> 02:22:27,959
..we will drown them in their own blood.

1253
02:22:45,800 --> 02:22:49,319
Bury your martyrs.

1254
02:22:50,200 --> 02:22:53,239
Prepare the army.

1255
02:22:53,520 --> 02:22:57,839
We will bury those who did this under this earth

1256
02:23:00,080 --> 02:23:04,319
It's time for war!

1257
02:23:21,908 --> 02:23:33,818
Visit turkision.com for more!